msgstr ":guilabel:`Nye muligheder`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:134
msgid ":guilabel:`New Sales Orders`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Nye salgsordrer`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:136
msgid ""
"Enter a :guilabel:`Target` for the goal based on the :guilabel:`Suffix`."
msgstr ""
"Indtast en :guilabel:`Målsætning` for målet baseret på :guilabel:`Suffiks`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:138
msgid "Repeat these steps for each additional goal."
msgstr "Gentag disse trin for hvert yderligere mål."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:140
msgid "The goals tab of a challenge form."
msgstr "Fanen mål i en udfordringsformular."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:145
msgid "Add rewards"
msgstr "Tilføj belønninger"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:147
msgid ""
"Next, click the :guilabel:`Reward` tab. Choose the :ref:`badges <crm/create-"
"rewards>` to be awarded :guilabel:`For 1st User` and :guilabel:`For Every "
"Succeeding User` by selecting them from the drop-down lists."
msgstr ""
"Klik derefter på fanen :guilabel:`Belønning`. Vælg de :ref:`badges <crm/"
"create-rewards>`, der skal tildeles :guilabel:`For 1. bruger` "
"og :guilabel:`For hver efterfølgende bruger` ved at vælge dem fra "
"rullemenuen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:152
msgid ""
"Badges are granted when a challenge is finished. This is either at the end "
"of a running period, at the end date of a challenge, or when the challenge "
"is manually closed."
msgstr ""
"Badges tildeles, når en udfordring er afsluttet. Dette sker enten ved "
"slutningen af en løbende periode, ved slutdatoen for en udfordring, eller "
"når udfordringen lukkes manuelt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/gamification.rst:155
msgid ""
"After setup is complete, click the :guilabel:`Start Challenge` button at the "
"top-left of the page to begin the challenge."
msgstr ""
"Når opsætningen er fuldført, klik på knappen :guilabel:`Start udfordring` "
"øverst til venstre på siden for at begynde udfordringen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/lead_enrichment.rst:3
msgid "Lead enrichment"
msgstr "Forbedring af leads"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/lead_enrichment.rst:5
msgid ""
"*Lead enrichment* is an In-App Purchase (IAP) service that provides business "
"information for a contact attached to a lead. Using lead enrichment requires "
"credits and is available for existing leads in an Odoo database. Enterprise "
"Odoo users with a valid subscription receive free credits to test :abbr:`IAP "
"(In-App Purchase)`. This applies to demo/training, educational, and one-app-"
"free databases."
msgstr ""
"*Lead-berigelse* er en In-App Purchase (IAP)-tjeneste, der leverer "
"forretningsinformation for en kontakt knyttet til et lead. Brug af lead-"
"berigelse kræver kreditter og er tilgængelig for eksisterende leads i en "
"Odoo-database. Enterprise Odoo-brugere med et gyldigt abonnement modtager "
"gratis kreditter til at teste :abbr:`IAP (In-App Purchase)`. Dette gælder "
"for demo/trænings-, uddannelsesmæssige og én-app-gratis-databaser."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/lead_enrichment.rst:11
msgid ""
"The information provided by lead enrichment can include general information "
"about the business (including full business name and logo) and its size, "
"revenue, social media accounts, known technology use, and more."
msgstr ""
"Informationen leveret af lead-berigelse kan omfatte generel information om "
"virksomheden (herunder fuldt firmanavn og logo) og dens størrelse, "
"omsætning, sociale mediekonti, kendt teknologibrug og mere."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/lead_enrichment.rst:15
msgid ""
"The *Leads* feature :ref:`must be configured <crm/configure-leads>` in the "
"**CRM** app's settings page in order to use lead enrichment."
msgstr ""
"*Leads*-funktionen :ref:`skal konfigureres <crm/configure-leads>` på **CRM**-"
"appens indstillingsside for at bruge lead-berigelse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/lead_enrichment.rst:18
msgid "Chatter showing lead enrichment data."
msgstr "Chatter viser leadberigelsedata."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/lead_enrichment.rst:22
msgid ""
"When collecting a company's contact information, be aware of the latest EU "
"regulations. For more information about the General Data Protection "
"Regulation, refer to the `Odoo GDPR <http://odoo.com/gdpr>`__."
msgstr ""
"Når du indsamler en virksomheds kontaktinformation, skal du være opmærksom "
"på de seneste EU-regler. For mere information om den generelle "
"databeskyttelsesforordning, se `Odoo GDPR <http://odoo.com/gdpr>`__."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/lead_enrichment.rst:27
msgid "Lead enrichment set up"
msgstr "Opsætning af leadberigelse"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/lead_enrichment.rst:29
msgid ""
"To set up lead enrichment in the **CRM** app, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> Settings`. Under "
"the :guilabel:`Lead Generation` section, select the checkbox next "
"to :guilabel:`Lead Enrichment`, and select either :guilabel:`Enrich leads on "
"demand only` or :guilabel:`Enrich all leads automatically`. Click "
"the :guilabel:`Save` button to activate the changes."
msgstr ""
"For at konfigurere lead-berigelse i **CRM**-appen skal du navigere "
"til :menuselection:`CRM-app --> Konfiguration --> Indstillinger`. Under "
"afsnittet :guilabel:`Lead-generering` skal du markere afkrydsningsfeltet ved "
"siden af :guilabel:`Lead-berigelse` og vælge enten :guilabel:`Berig kun "
"leads efter behov` eller :guilabel:`Berig alle leads automatisk`. Klik på "
"knappen :guilabel:`Gem` for at aktivere ændringerne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/lead_enrichment.rst:35
msgid ""
"The CRM lead generation settings page with lead enrichment activation "
"highlighted and\n"
"enrich leads on demand only chosen."
msgstr ""
"CRM lead-genereringsindstillingssiden med lead-berigelsesaktivering "
"fremhævet og\n"
"berig kun leads efter behov valgt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/lead_enrichment.rst:40
msgid "Automatic and manual enrichment"
msgstr "Automatisk og manuel berigelse"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/lead_enrichment.rst:42
msgid ""
"Lead enrichment is based on the customer's email domain set on the lead. "
"There are two different ways that a lead can be enriched: *automatically* or "
"*manually*."
msgstr ""
"Lead-berigelse er baseret på kundens e-maildomæne sat på leadet. Der er to "
"forskellige måder, hvorpå et lead kan beriges: *automatisk* eller *manuelt*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/lead_enrichment.rst:46
msgid "Automatically enrich leads"
msgstr "Berig leads automatisk"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/lead_enrichment.rst:48
msgid ""
"On the *Settings* page, if *Enrich all leads automatically* was selected, no "
"user action is required to enrich the lead. Once every 60 minutes, a "
"scheduled action contacts a remote database and enriches any unenriched "
"leads."
msgstr ""
"På siden *Indstillinger*, hvis *Berig alle leads automatisk* blev valgt, "
"kræves ingen brugerhandling for at berige leadet. En gang hvert 60. minut "
"kontakter en planlagt handling en ekstern database og beriger alle uberigede "
"leads."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/lead_enrichment.rst:52
msgid ""
"To change the behind-the-scenes rules for automatic lead enrichment, "
"activate :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`. With developer mode active, "
"type \"scheduled actions\" in the main Odoo dashboard to bring up "
"the :icon:`fa-search` :guilabel:`(Search for a menu)` screen. "
"Click :guilabel:`Settings / Technical / Automation / Scheduled Actions` to "
"navigate to the Scheduled Actions page. In the search bar, type \"enrich "
"leads\" and click the :guilabel:`CRM\\: enrich leads IAP` action. From this "
"page, automatic lead enrichment can be changed, including the execution "
"interval, priority, and more. The minimum value for the :guilabel:`Execute "
"Every` field is 5 minutes."
msgstr ""
"For at ændre reglerne bag kulisserne for automatisk lead-berigelse skal du "
"aktivere :ref:`udviklertilstand <developer-mode>`. Med udviklertilstand "
"aktiv skal du skrive \"planlagte handlinger\" i Odoos hoveddashboard for at "
"få vist skærmen :icon:`fa-search` :guilabel:`(Søg efter en menu)`. Klik "
"på :guilabel:`Indstillinger / Teknisk / Automatisering / Planlagte "
"handlinger` for at navigere til siden Planlagte handlinger. I søgefeltet "
"skal du skrive \"berig leads\" og klikke på handlingen :guilabel:`CRM\\: "
"berig leads IAP`. Fra denne side kan automatisk lead-berigelse ændres, "
"herunder udførelsesinterval, prioritet og mere. Minimumsværdien for "
"feltet :guilabel:`Udfør hver` er 5 minutter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/lead_enrichment.rst:61
msgid "Manually enrich leads"
msgstr "Berig leads manuelt"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/lead_enrichment.rst:63
msgid ""
"If *Lead Enrichment* is set to :guilabel:`Enrich leads on demand only`, "
"leads must be manually enriched. This is done by clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Enrich` button in the lead's page top menu. This retrieves "
"the same information as automatic enrichment at the same cost (one credit "
"per enrichment). This method of enrichment is useful when not every lead "
"needs to be enriched or when cost is an issue."
msgstr ""
"Hvis *Lead-berigelse* er indstillet til :guilabel:`Berig kun leads efter "
"behov`, skal leads beriges manuelt. Dette gøres ved at klikke på "
"knappen :guilabel:`Berig` i leadets topmenu. Dette henter den samme "
"information som automatisk berigelse til samme pris (en kredit pr. "
"berigelse). Denne metode til berigelse er nyttig, når ikke hvert lead skal "
"beriges, eller når pris er et problem."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/lead_enrichment.rst:69
msgid ""
"Multiple leads can be manually enriched in a single step using the *list* "
"view. First, navigate to the :menuselection:`CRM app --> Leads`, then click "
"the :icon:`fa-align-justify` :guilabel:`(List)` button. Click the checkboxes "
"for the leads that need manual enrichment. Finally, click the :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon, then select :guilabel:`Enrich` from the "
"resulting drop-down menu. Multiple leads can also be enriched at once from "
"the *My Pipeline* and *Pipeline* pages. To do so, open the **CRM** app. On "
"the *My Pipeline* page, click the :icon:`fa-close` :guilabel:`(Remove)` icon "
"in the search bar to show the entire pipeline, if desired. Then click "
"the :icon:`fa-align-justify` :guilabel:`(List)` button to switch to the list "
"view and select the leads to enrich."
msgstr ""
"Flere leads kan beriges manuelt i et enkelt trin ved hjælp af *liste*-"
"visningen. Først skal du navigere til :menuselection:`CRM-app --> Leads`, og "
"derefter klikke på knappen :icon:`fa-align-justify` :guilabel:`(Liste)`. "
"Klik på afkrydsningsfelterne for de leads, der skal beriges manuelt. Klik "
"endelig på ikonet :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(Handlinger)`, og vælg "
"derefter :guilabel:`Berig` fra den resulterende rullemenuen. Flere leads kan "
"også beriges på én gang fra siderne *Min pipeline* og *Pipeline*. For at "
"gøre det skal du åbne **CRM**-appen. På siden *Min pipeline* skal du klikke "
"på ikonet :icon:`fa-close` :guilabel:`(Fjern)` i søgefeltet for at vise hele "
"pipelinen, hvis ønsket. Klik derefter på knappen :icon:`fa-align-"
"justify` :guilabel:`(Liste)` for at skifte til listevisningen og vælge de "
"leads, der skal beriges."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/lead_enrichment.rst:82
msgid ""
"Lead enrichment is an In-App Purchase (IAP) feature, and each enriched lead "
"costs one credit. If the database has no available credits, only the lead's "
"website and logo are provided during enrichment. Pricing information for "
"credits can be found on the `Lead Generation <https://iap.odoo.com/iap/in-"
"app-services/167>`_ page."
msgstr ""
"Lead-berigelse er en In-App Purchase (IAP)-funktion, og hvert beriget lead "
"koster en kredit. Hvis databasen ikke har nogen tilgængelige kreditter, "
"leveres kun leadets hjemmeside og logo under berigelse. Prisinformation for "
"kreditter kan findes på siden `Lead-generering <https://iap.odoo.com/iap/in-"
"app-services/167>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/lead_enrichment.rst:87
msgid ""
"To buy credits, navigate to :menuselection:`CRM app --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`. In the :guilabel:`Lead Generation` section, under "
"the :guilabel:`Lead Enrichment` feature, click on :guilabel:`Manage Service "
"& Buy Credits`."
msgstr ""
"For at købe kreditter skal du navigere til :menuselection:`CRM-app --> "
"Konfiguration --> Indstillinger`. I afsnittet :guilabel:`Lead-generering` "
"under funktionen :guilabel:`Lead-berigelse` skal du klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Administrer tjeneste og køb kreditter`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/lead_enrichment.rst:92
msgid ""
"Because credits are not interchangeable between IAP services, clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Manage Service & Buy Credits` link under the :guilabel:`Lead "
"Mining` sub-header does **not** lead to a web page where *Lead Enrichment* "
"credits can be purchased."
msgstr ""
"Fordi kreditter ikke kan udveksles mellem IAP-tjenester, fører klik på "
"linket :guilabel:`Administrer tjeneste og køb kreditter` under "
"underoverskriften :guilabel:`Lead-mining` **ikke** til en webside, hvor "
"*Lead-berigelse*-kreditter kan købes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/lead_enrichment.rst:96
msgid ""
"Credits may also be purchased by navigating to the :guilabel:`Settings` app "
"and scrolling to the :guilabel:`Contacts` section. Under the :guilabel:`Odoo "
"IAP` feature, click :guilabel:`View My Services`. From there, every active "
"IAP service in the database can be viewed and credits can be purchased by "
"selecting one and clicking the :guilabel:`Buy Credit` link."
msgstr ""
"Kreditter kan også købes ved at navigere til appen :guilabel:`Indstillinger` "
"og rulle til afsnittet :guilabel:`Adressebog`. Under "
"funktionen :guilabel:`Odoo IAP` skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Vis mine "
"tjenester`. Derfra kan hver aktiv IAP-tjeneste i databasen ses, og kreditter "
"kan købes ved at vælge en og klikke på linket :guilabel:`Køb kredit`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/optimize/lead_enrichment.rst:105
