"anvendes oven på :ref:`crm/track_leads/essential-filters` i den angivne "
"rækkefølge for at opnå et meget detaljeret filter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:183
msgid ""
"**Referred-by:** Filter for referrals, such as by appointment or sales "
"member."
msgstr ""
"**Henvist af:** Filtrer efter henvisninger, såsom gennem aftale eller "
