#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/employee_login.rst:361
msgid "Employee login"
msgstr "Medarbejderlogin"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/employee_login.rst:363
msgid ""
"Once the :guilabel:`Log in with Employees` setting is enabled, employees "
"must log in to :ref:`access the POS register <pos/use/open-register>`. They "
"can :ref:`scan their employee badge <pos/employee-login/user-login>`, click "
"the :icon:`fa-users` icon (:guilabel:`users`) to select their name from the "
"list of authorized employees, or enter :ref:`their PIN code <pos/"
"employee_login/pin>` in the :guilabel:`Enter your PIN` field."
msgstr ""
"Når indstillingen :guilabel:`Log ind med medarbejdere` er aktiveret, skal "
"medarbejdere logge ind for at :ref:`få adgang til POS-kassen <pos/use/open-"
"register>`. De kan :ref:`scanne deres medarbejderskilt <pos/employee-login/"
"user-login>`, klikke på ikonet :icon:`fa-users` (:guilabel:`brugere`) for at "
"vælge deres navn på listen over autoriserede medarbejdere eller "
"indtaste :ref:`deres PIN-kode <pos/employee_login/pin>` i "
"feltet :guilabel:`Indtast din PIN`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/employee_login.rst:369
msgid ""
"Login window to access the register when the multiple cashiers feature is "
"active"
msgstr ""
"Loginvindue til at få adgang til kassen, når funktionen til flere "
"kassemedarbejdere er aktiv"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/employee_login.rst:372
msgid ""
"To switch between employees from the :ref:`POS register <pos/use/open-"
"register>`, click the currently logged-in employee's name at the top right "
"of the POS interface and select the employee to switch to. Alternatively, "
"click the :icon:`fa-unlock` (:guilabel:`Lock`) icon in the upper-right "
"corner to lock the register, allowing the next employee to log in."
msgstr ""
"For at skifte mellem medarbejdere fra :ref:`POS-kassen <pos/use/open-"
"register>` skal du klikke på navnet på den aktuelt indloggede medarbejder "
"øverst til højre i POS-grænsefladen og vælge den medarbejder, der skal "
"skiftes til. Alternativt kan du klikke på ikonet :icon:`fa-unlock` "
"(:guilabel:`Lås`) i øverste højre hjørne for at låse kassen, så den næste "
"medarbejder kan logge ind."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/employee_login.rst:378
msgid ""
"If a PIN code is associated with an employee, they will be asked to enter it "
"even after scanning the badge or selecting their name."
msgstr ""
"Hvis der er knyttet en PIN-kode til en medarbejder, bliver vedkommende bedt "
"om at indtaste den, selv efter scanning af skiltet eller valg af sit navn."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/employee_login.rst:382
msgid ""
"In the absence of a scanner, click the :icon:`fa-barcode` icon "
"(:guilabel:`barcode`) to scan barcodes using your device's webcam."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du ikke har en scanner, kan du klikke på ikonet :icon:`fa-barcode` "
"(:guilabel:`stregkode`) for at scanne stregkoder ved hjælp af din enheds "
"webcam."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:5
msgid ""
"The preparation display helps manage POS orders that require preparation "
"prior to completion. It is intended for use in environments where ordered "
"items must be assembled, cooked, or otherwise processed before they are "
"handed over to the customer."
msgstr ""
"Forberedelsesdisplayet hjælper med at administrere POS-ordrer, der kræver "
"forberedelse inden færdiggørelse. Det er beregnet til brug i miljøer, hvor "
"bestilte varer skal samles, tilberedes eller på anden måde behandles, før de "
"udleveres til kunden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:9
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:121
msgid "Use cases"
msgstr "Anvendelsestilfælde"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:11
msgid ""
"**For retail**: Once an order is completed and paid in the :ref:`POS "
"register <pos/use/open-register>`, it is sent to the preparation display. "
"This notifies the preparation team to collect and prepare the purchased "
"items for customer pickup."
msgstr ""
"**For detail**: Når en ordre er gennemført og betalt i :ref:`POS-registret "
"<pos/use/open-register>`, sendes den til forberedelsesdisplayet. Dette "
"underretter forberedelsesholdet om at indsamle og forberede de købte varer "
"til kundeafhentning."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:14
msgid ""
"**For restaurants**: Once orders are placed in the :ref:`POS register <pos/"
"use/open-register>`, they are sent to the preparation display to inform the "
"kitchen about the meals that need to be prepared."
msgstr ""
"**For restauranter**: Når ordrer er afgivet i :ref:`POS-registret <pos/use/"
"open-register>`, sendes de til forberedelsesdisplayet for at informere "
"køkkenet om de måltider, der skal tilberedes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/preparation.rst:23
