"the cart."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :guilabel:`Sælg fysisk gavekort?` under gavekortproduktet i kurven."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:164
msgid "Enter or scan the physical gift card code in the popover."
msgstr "Indtast eller scan koden på det fysiske gavekort i pop op-vinduet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:165
msgid "Adjust the amount and expiration date, if necessary."
msgstr "Juster beløbet og udløbsdatoen, hvis nødvendigt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:166
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Add Balance`."
msgstr "Klik på :guilabel:`Tilføj saldo`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:169
msgid ""
"If the gift card code already exists in Odoo, click :guilabel:`Add existing "
"Gift Card` to attach it to the order."
msgstr ""
"Hvis gavekortkoden allerede findes i Odoo, skal du klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Tilføj eksisterende gavekort` for at knytte det til ordren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/pricing.rst:173
msgid "Hand the physical card to the customer."
msgstr "Overrek det fysiske kort til kunden."

