"deres personlige enhed. Sidstnævnte giver dem også mulighed for at afgive en "
"ordre og foretage en betaling. Derefter:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:28
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Print QR Codes` to download a .pdf "
"document with the generated QR codes."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Print QR Codes` for at downloade "
"et .pdf-dokument med de genererede QR-koder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:30
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Download QR Codes` to download a "
"compressed file with the generated QR codes."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Download QR Codes` for at "
"downloade en komprimeret fil med de genererede QR-koder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:32
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Free Metal / Wood Stands` to `order "
"QR code stands from Odoo <https://www.odoo.com/app/point-of-sale-restaurant-"
"qr-code>`_."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Gratis metal-/træstandere` for at "
"`bestille QR-kodestandere fra Odoo <https://www.odoo.com/app/point-of-sale-"
"restaurant-qr-code>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:36
msgid ""
"In :ref:`restaurants <pos/restaurant/floors>`, printing or downloading QR "
"codes generates as many QR codes as the number of available tables. In "
"**shops**, it generates only one generic QR code."
msgstr ""
"I :ref:`restauranter <pos/restaurant/floors>` genererer udskrivning eller "
"download af QR-koder lige så mange QR-koder som antallet af tilgængelige "
"borde. I **butikker** genererer det kun én generisk QR-kode."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:40
msgid ""
"To customize QR codes, scan the relevant QR code to acquire its URL, then "
"use a QR code generator (e.g., `QR code monkey <https://www.qrcode-"
"monkey.com>`_, `QR code generator <https://www.qr-code-generator.com>`_, or "
"`JustMakeTheQRCode.com <https://justmaketheqrcode.com/>`_) to create a "
"custom QR code."
msgstr ""
"For at tilpasse QR-koder skal du scanne den relevante QR-kode for at hente "
"dens URL og derefter bruge en QR-kodegenerator (f.eks. `QR code monkey "
"<https://www.qrcode-monkey.com>`_, `QR code generator <https://www.qr-code-"
"generator.com>`_ eller `JustMakeTheQRCode.com <https://justmaketheqrcode.com/"
">`_) til at oprette en tilpasset QR-kode."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:47
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`Kiosk` to let customers browse the menu or product "
"catalog, place orders, and pay directly at a self-ordering kiosk."
msgstr ""
"Vælg :guilabel:`Kiosk` for at lade kunder gennemse menuen eller "
"produktkataloget, afgive ordrer og betale direkte ved en selvbetjeningskiosk."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:50
msgid ""
"Once a self-ordering type is selected, click :icon:`fa-arrow-"
"right` :guilabel:`Preview Web interface` under the :guilabel:`Self Ordering` "
