msgstr ""
"Uanset konfigurationen af selvbestilling kan der kun tilføjes "
"én :guilabel:`Onlinebetaling`-metode."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:131
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Payment Methods` to :doc:`create or "
"edit payment methods <../payment_methods>`."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Betalingsmetoder` for "
"at :doc:`oprette eller redigere betalingsmetoder <../payment_methods>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:135
msgid ":doc:`/applications/finance/payment_providers`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/finance/payment_providers`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/extra/self_order.rst:136
msgid ":doc:`../payment_methods`"
msgstr ":doc:`../payment_methods`"

