#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/glory.rst:3
msgid "Glory"
msgstr "Glory"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/glory.rst:5
msgid ""
"`Glory <https://www.glory-global.com/en-us>`_ :doc:`cash machines <../"
"cash_machines>` enable the automation of cash transactions."
msgstr ""
"<https://www.glory-global.com/en-us>Glory:doc:`-kontantmaskiner <../"
"cash_machines>` muliggør automatisering af kontanttransaktioner."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/glory.rst:9
msgid "Odoo supports the Glory CI-5, CI-10, and CI-10X models."
msgstr "Odoo understøtter Glory CI-5, CI-10 og CI-10X modellerne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/glory.rst:10
msgid ""
"The Glory machine must run firmware version ISP-K05H/B v18.40 or later. Any "
"version starting with ISP-K35 is **not supported**."
msgstr ""
"Glory-maskinen skal køre firmwareversion ISP-K05H/B v18.40 eller nyere. "
"Enhver version, der starter med ISP-K35, er **ikke understøttet**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/glory.rst:13
msgid ""
"The integration with the Glory cash machine only supports basic functions, "
"such as cash transactions and cash count checks."
msgstr ""
"Integrationen med Glory-pengeautomaten understøtter kun basale funktioner "
"såsom kontanttransaktioner og kontrol af kontantoptælling."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/glory.rst:24
msgid "Cash machine settings"
msgstr "Indstillinger for pengeautomat"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/glory.rst:26
msgid ""
"Power on the cash machine, which briefly displays its IP address at the "
"bottom of the screen. Note it down for later."
msgstr ""
"Tænd for pengeautomaten, som kortvarigt viser sin IP-adresse nederst på "
"skærmen. Notér den til senere brug."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/glory.rst:30
msgid ""
"The IP address should be formatted as `###.###.#.##` (e.g., `192.168.0.25`)."
msgstr ""
"IP-adressen skal være formateret som `###.###.#.##` (f.eks. `192.168.0.25`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/glory.rst:32
msgid ""
"Navigate to the cash machine's homepage by entering its IP address as the "
"URL in `HTTPS` (e.g., `https://192.168.0.25`), and log in with your Glory "
"credentials."
msgstr ""
"Naviger til pengeautomatens hjemmeside ved at indtaste dens IP-adresse som "
"URL i `HTTPS` (f.eks. `https://192.168.0.25`), og log ind med dine Glory-"
"legitimationsoplysninger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/glory.rst:34
msgid ""
"As long as the certificate is not imported, a warning page appears when "
"trying to access the machine's homepage. Bypass it by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Advanced` and then :guilabel:`Proceed to [IP address] "
"(unsafe)`."
msgstr ""
"Så længe certifikatet ikke er importeret, vises en advarselsside, når man "
"forsøger at tilgå maskinens hjemmeside. Omgå den ved at klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Avanceret` og derefter :guilabel:`Fortsæt til [IP-adresse] "
"(usikkert)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/glory.rst:37
msgid ""
"From the Glory homepage, go to :guilabel:`Host Configuration` and ensure "
"the :guilabel:`Network` setting is set to :guilabel:`MANUAL`, meaning the IP "
"address is static."
msgstr ""
"Fra Glory-hjemmesiden skal du gå til :guilabel:`Host Configuration` og sikre "
"dig, at :guilabel:`Network`-indstillingen er sat til :guilabel:`MANUAL`, "
"hvilket betyder, at IP-adressen er statisk."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/glory.rst:39
msgid ""
"Then, navigate to :guilabel:`SSL Configuration` and scroll down to "
"the :guilabel:`HTTPS Server Setting` section."
msgstr ""
"Naviger derefter til :guilabel:`SSL Configuration` og rul ned til "
"sektionen :guilabel:`HTTPS Server Setting`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/glory.rst:42
msgid ""
"In parallel, open the terminal and verify that *OpenSSL* is installed. Type "
"`openssl` and press enter. If installed, this command displays a `help` menu "
"listing all available OpenSSL commands. If nothing happens, `install it "
"<https://openssl-library.org/source/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Åbn parallelt terminalen og kontrollér, at *OpenSSL* er installeret. Skriv "
"`openssl` og tryk enter. Hvis det er installeret, viser denne kommando en "
"`help`-menu med alle tilgængelige OpenSSL-kommandoer. Hvis der ikke sker "
"noget, `installer det <https://openssl-library.org/source/>`_."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/glory.rst:45
msgid ""
"Then, paste the following command and press `Enter` to generate and download "
"the certificate and private key. Ensure that you replace the demo IP address "
"with the cash machine’s actual IP address."
msgstr ""
"Indsæt derefter følgende kommando og tryk `Enter` for at generere og "
"downloade certifikatet og den private nøgle. Sørg for at erstatte demo-IP-"
"adressen med pengeautomatens faktiske IP-adresse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/glory.rst:54
msgid ""
"The self-signed SSL certificate and key pair must use the same static IP "
"address as the cash machine."
msgstr ""
"Det selvsignerede SSL-certifikat og nøglepar skal bruge samme statiske IP-"
"adresse som pengeautomaten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/glory.rst:57
msgid ""
"Once the files are generated, from the :guilabel:`HTTPS Server Setting` "
"section, upload `cert.pem` as the :guilabel:`Certificate` and `key.pem` as "
"the :guilabel:`Private Key`."
msgstr ""
"Når filerne er genereret, skal du fra sektionen :guilabel:`HTTPS Server "
"Setting` uploade `cert.pem` som :guilabel:`Certificate` og `key.pem` "
"som :guilabel:`Private Key`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/glory.rst:59
msgid ""
"Go to :guilabel:`WebApp Configuration` and ensure the :guilabel:`Interface` "
"setting from the :guilabel:`A: Nodejs Setting` section is set "
"to :guilabel:`Enable`."
msgstr ""
"Gå til :guilabel:`WebApp Configuration` og sørg for, "
"at :guilabel:`Interface`-indstillingen fra sektionen :guilabel:`A: Nodejs "
"Setting` er sat til :guilabel:`Enable`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/glory.rst:61
msgid "Then, adjust the following settings depending on the POS setup:"
msgstr "Justér derefter følgende indstillinger afhængigt af POS-opsætningen:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/glory.rst:63
msgid ""
"If **multiple POS** are connected to the same cash machine, go "
"to :guilabel:`App Configuration`, scroll down to the :guilabel:`SOAP IF "
"Setting`, and ensure :guilabel:`Session mode` and :guilabel:`Occupy mode` "
"are both set to :guilabel:`Enable`."
msgstr ""
"Hvis **flere POS** er forbundet til samme pengeautomat, skal du gå "
"til :guilabel:`App Configuration`, rulle ned til :guilabel:`SOAP IF "
"Setting`, og sikre dig, at :guilabel:`Session mode` og :guilabel:`Occupy "
"mode` begge er sat til :guilabel:`Enable`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/glory.rst:66
msgid ""
"If **a dedicated user** has been set up on the cash machine for Odoo, which "
"is recommended, go to :guilabel:`App Configuration`, scroll down to "
"the :guilabel:`SOAP IF Setting` section, and :guilabel:`Enable` "
"the :guilabel:`User check` setting."
msgstr ""
"Hvis **en dedikeret bruger** er blevet oprettet på kontantmaskinen til Odoo, "
"hvilket anbefales, gå til :guilabel:`App-konfiguration`, rul ned til "
"afsnittet :guilabel:`SOAP IF-indstilling`, og :guilabel:`Aktivér` "
"indstillingen :guilabel:`Brugerkontrol`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/glory.rst:69
msgid "Restart the cash machine to apply the new settings."
msgstr "Genstart pengeautomaten for at anvende de nye indstillinger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/cash_machines/glory.rst:72
msgid ""
"As this setup is complex and may involve advanced knowledge of Glory "
"hardware, it is advisable to consult the Glory integration partner for "
"configuration if there is any uncertainty."
msgstr ""
"Da denne opsætning er kompleks og kan kræve avanceret kendskab til Glory-"
"hardware, er det tilrådeligt at konsultere Glory-integrationspartneren "
"angående konfiguration, hvis der er nogen usikkerhed."

