#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals.rst:55
msgid ""
"To process an order :ref:`payment <pos/use/sell>` using a :ref:`configured "
"terminal <pos/terminals/configuration>` in the :ref:`POS register <pos/use/"
"open-register>`, select the terminal's :doc:`payment method <../"
"payment_methods>` on the :guilabel:`Payment` screen, then follow the "
"instructions displayed on the terminal screen."
msgstr ""
"For at behandle en ordre:ref:`betaling <pos/use/sell>` ved hjælp af "
"en :ref:`konfigureret terminal <pos/terminals/configuration>` i :ref:`POS-"
"kasseapparatet <pos/use/open-register>` skal du vælge "
"terminalens :doc:`betalingsmetode <../payment_methods>` "
"på :guilabel:`Payment`-skærmen og derefter følge instruktionerne vist på "
"terminalskærmen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals.rst:60
msgid ""
"Once the transaction is successful, the payment is automatically validated "
"in the POS register."
msgstr ""
"Når transaktionen er gennemført, valideres betalingen automatisk i POS-"
"kasseapparatet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals.rst:63
msgid ""
"If a connection issue occurs between Odoo and the payment terminal, the "
"transaction is automatically canceled."
msgstr ""
"Hvis der opstår et forbindelsesproblem mellem Odoo og betalingsterminalen, "
"annulleres transaktionen automatisk."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals.rst:65
