msgid ""
"The **Asynchronous Notifications** are automated messages confirming "
"successful payments or refunds by QFPay."
msgstr ""
"De **asynkrone notifikationer** er automatiserede meddelelser, der bekræfter "
"vellykkede betalinger eller refusioner fra QFPay."

