"When you use **Stripe** exclusively in Point of Sale, you only need the "
"**Secret Key** to use your terminal."
msgstr ""
"Når du bruger **Stripe** udelukkende i POS, skal du kun bruge **Secret Key** "
"til at bruge din terminal."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals/stripe.rst:66
msgid ""
