"`Stripe dashboard <https://dashboard.stripe.com>`_, skrive `API` i "
"søgefeltet og klikke på :guilabel:`Developers > API`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/payment_methods/terminals/stripe.rst:74
