msgstr ""
"Hvis :doc:`online madleveringsplatforme <restaurant/urban_piper>` er "
"konfigureret i din database, skal du angive deres :guilabel:`Servicetider`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:332
msgid ""
"After creating POS product categories, assign them to specific products on "
