"tilsvarende produkter ved siden af ikonet :icon:`fa-list` "
"(:guilabel:`Gyldigt produktparti`). Ikonets farve fremhæver, om sporingen er "
"blevet tildelt:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/point_of_sale/products.rst:537
msgid ""
"**Green** :icon:`fa-list` (:guilabel:`Valid product lot`) **icon**: The "
"tracking number was successfully imported or assigned."
msgstr ""
"**Grønt** :icon:`fa-list` (:guilabel:`Gyldigt produktparti`) **ikon**: "
