"Using a :doc:`barcode scanner <../../inventory_and_mrp/barcode/setup/"
"hardware>` improves efficiency and provides quicker customer service. In "
"Point of Sale, scanners are used to add products to a cart, apply discounts, "
"or log employees into the POS register."
msgstr ""
"Brug af en :doc:`stregkodescanner <../../inventory_and_mrp/barcode/setup/"
"hardware>` forbedrer effektiviteten og giver hurtigere kundeservice. I POS "
"bruges scannere til at tilføje produkter til en kurv, anvende rabatter eller "
"logge medarbejdere ind på POS-kassen."

