#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/labor_service_products.rst:98
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Periodicity`: The unit of time the product uses for rental prices."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Periodicitet`: Den tidsenhed, produktet bruger til lejepriser."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/labor_service_products.rst:99
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Padding Time`: Blocks a rental product from being available for "
"reservations. The setting is set to an hourly unit. This is available only "
"if :guilabel:`Hours` is selected in the :guilabel:`Periodicity` field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Buffertid`: Blokerer et udlejningsprodukt fra at være "
"tilgængeligt for reservationer. Indstillingen er angivet i en timeenhed. "
"Dette er kun tilgængeligt, hvis :guilabel:`Timer` er valgt i "
"feltet :guilabel:`Periodicitet`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/labor_service_products.rst:102
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:118
