#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:120
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Return`: The latest time the customer can return the product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Returnering`: Det seneste tidspunkt, kunden kan returnere "
