#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/product_type.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo allows for two :ref:`product types <inventory/type/good-or-services>` "
"when configuring a rental product: Goods or Services."
msgstr ""
"Odoo tillader to :ref:`produkttyper <inventory/type/good-or-services>` ved "
"konfiguration af et udlejningsprodukt: Varer eller Tjenester."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/product_type.rst:8
msgid ""
"*Goods*: Includes physical items. Goods are removed from the company's "
"stock, delivered to the customer, and then returned."
msgstr ""
"*Varer*: Omfatter fysiske genstande. Varer fjernes fra virksomhedens lager, "
"leveres til kunden og returneres derefter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/product_type.rst:10
msgid ""
"*Services*: Includes labor, non-physical, or a physical item that never "
"leaves the company's stock, such as a hotel room, workstation, or storage "
"unit."
msgstr ""
"*Tjenester*: Omfatter arbejdskraft, ikke-fysiske ydelser eller en fysisk "
"genstand, der aldrig forlader virksomhedens lager, såsom et hotelværelse, en "
"arbejdsstation eller en lagerenhed."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/product_type.rst:13
msgid ""
"The following sections detail basic settings and app integration "
"configurations for goods and services."
msgstr ""
"Følgende afsnit beskriver grundlæggende indstillinger og app-"
"integrationskonfigurationer for varer og tjenester."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/product_type.rst:17
