#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:34
msgid ""
"Before creating a service product in the **Rental** app, "
"configure :ref:`materials <planning/materials>` and :ref:`create a role "
"<planning/roles>` in the **Planning** app for the physical rental products "
"(such as storage units or conference rooms)."
msgstr ""
"Før du opretter et serviceprodukt i **Leje**-appen, skal du "
"konfigurere :ref:`materialer <planning/materials>` og :ref:`oprette en rolle "
"<planning/roles>` i **Planlægning**-appen for de fysiske udlejningsprodukter "
"(såsom opbevaringsenheder eller mødelokaler)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:38
msgid ""
"This allows the **Planning** app to create and assign shifts for the "
"physical rental product, and the *Role* links the rental materials to the "
"rental service. Whenever the service is added to a rental order, the "
"**Rental** app syncs with the **Planning** app to check and update the "
"material shift availability."
msgstr ""
"Dette gør det muligt for **Planlægning**-appen at oprette og tildele vagter "
"til det fysiske udlejningsprodukt, og *Rollen* forbinder "
"udlejningsmaterialerne med udlejningsservicen. Hver gang servicen tilføjes "
"til en lejeordre, synkroniserer **Leje**-appen med **Planlægning**-appen for "
"at kontrollere og opdatere materialevagternes tilgængelighed."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:44
msgid "It's recommended to name the role after the service."
msgstr "Det anbefales at navngive rollen efter servicen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:47
msgid ""
"Shady Grove needs to add a new room tier to the **Rental** app, the *Deluxe "
"Room*. There are seven rooms that belong in this tier. Create a new *Role* "
"by navigating to the :menuselection:`Planning app --> Configuration --> "
"Roles`. Click :guilabel:`New` and create the :guilabel:`Deluxe Room Role`."
msgstr ""
"Shady Grove skal tilføje et nyt værelsesniveau til appen **Udlejning**, "
"nemlig *Deluxe Room*. Der er syv værelser, der hører til dette niveau. Opret "
"en ny *Rolle* ved at navigere til :menuselection:`Planlægningsapp --> "
"Konfiguration --> Roller`. Klik på :guilabel:`Ny` og opret :guilabel:`Deluxe "
"Room-rolle`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:52
msgid "Example of configured role for the Deluxe Room."
msgstr "Eksempel på en konfigureret rolle for Deluxe-værelset."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:55
msgid ""
"To add the seven rooms as a resource for the *Role*, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Configuration --> Materials`. Click :guilabel:`New`, "
"enter the room number, and :guilabel:`Deluxe Room` for the :guilabel:`Role` "
"column. Repeat that process for all seven rooms."
msgstr ""
"For at tilføje de syv værelser som en ressource for denne *Rolle* skal du "
"navigere til :menuselection:`Konfiguration --> Materialer`. Klik "
"på :guilabel:`Ny`, indtast værelsesnummeret og :guilabel:`Deluxe Room` i "
"kolonnen :guilabel:`Rolle`. Gentag denne proces for alle syv værelser."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:59
msgid "Example of configured materials for the Deluxe Room."
msgstr "Eksempel på konfigureret materiale til Deluxe Room."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:62
msgid ""
"Create the :guilabel:`Deluxe Room` as a new *Service* product type by "
"navigating to :menuselection:`Rental app --> Products`. "
"Click :guilabel:`New`, then configure the Deluxe Room as "
"a :guilabel:`Service` type product with the :guilabel:`Plan Services` "
"checkbox enabled and the :guilabel:`Deluxe Room` role assigned."
msgstr ""
"Opret :guilabel:`Deluxe Room` som en ny produkttype af typen *Service* ved "
"at navigere til :menuselection:`Leje-appen --> Produkter`. Klik "
"på :guilabel:`Ny`, og konfigurer derefter Deluxe Room som en produkttype af "
"typen :guilabel:`Service` med afkrydsningsfeltet :guilabel:`Planlæg "
"tjenester` aktiveret og rollen :guilabel:`Deluxe Room` tildelt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:67
msgid "Example of the Plan Services field configured to the Deluxe Room role."
msgstr ""
"Eksempel på feltet Planlæg tjenester konfigureret til rollen Deluxe Room."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:83
msgid ""
"The **Sales** and **Planning** apps must be installed for the *Prepaid/Fixed "
"Price* option of the *Invoicing Policy* and *Plan Services* fields to be "
"available. Enabling the *Sales* checkbox displays the *Invoicing Policy*."
msgstr ""
"Appene **Salg** og **Planlægning** skal være installeret, for at "
"indstillingen *Forudbetalt/fast pris* for felterne *Faktureringspolitik* og "
"*Planlæg tjenester* er tilgængelig. Aktivering af afkrydsningsfeltet *Salg* "
"viser *Faktureringspolitik*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:87
msgid ""
"In the new product window, the :guilabel:`Sales` checkbox is already enabled "
"by default. Select the :guilabel:`Product Type` as :guilabel:`Service`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Invoicing Policy` drop-down menu, select :guilabel:`Prepaid/"
"Fixed Price`. Enable the :guilabel:`Plan Services` checkbox and "
"either :ref:`create a new role <planning/roles>` or select a pre-existing "
"one."
msgstr ""
"I det nye produktvindue er afkrydsningsfeltet :guilabel:`Salg` allerede "
"aktiveret som standard. Vælg :guilabel:`Produkttype` "
"som :guilabel:`Service`. I rullemenuen :guilabel:`Faktureringspolitik` "
"vælges :guilabel:`Forudbetalt/fast pris`. Aktivér "
"afkrydsningsfeltet :guilabel:`Planlæg tjenester`, og :ref:`opret en ny rolle "
"<planning/roles>`, eller vælg en eksisterende."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/configure_products/service_products.rst:92
