"by navigating to :menuselection:`Rental app --> Products --> Products` and "
"click the desired product to configure. Click the :guilabel:`Prices` tab and "
"select the :guilabel:`Photographer Rental` option for "
"the :guilabel:`Pricelist` column. Enter `8` in the :guilabel:`Min. Quantity` "
