#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:177
msgid ""
"For physical service products, such as hotel rooms, workstations, and "
"conference rooms, a final adjustment to the quantity may be needed on the "
"invoice."
msgstr ""
"For fysiske serviceprodukter, såsom hotelværelser, arbejdsstationer og "
"mødelokaler, kan en endelig justering af mængden være nødvendig på fakturaen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:180
msgid ""
"If there is a change in the number of units rented, enter the amount in "
"the :guilabel:`Quantity` column. If new charges were accrued during the "
"rental period, click :guilabel:`Add a line` to include them in the invoice "
"draft."
msgstr ""
"Hvis der sker en ændring i antallet af lejede enheder, skal du indtaste "
"beløbet i kolonnen :guilabel:`Antal`. Hvis der er påløbet nye gebyrer i "
"løbet af lejeperioden, skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Tilføj en linje` for at "
"inkludere dem i fakturakladden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:187
msgid "Confirm and pay"
msgstr "Bekræft og betal"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:189
msgid ""
"If all the details are correct on the invoice draft, either "
"click :guilabel:`Confirm` and click :guilabel:`Send` to email the invoice to "
"the customer, or click :guilabel:`Print` and then click :guilabel:`Pay` if "
"the customer is in person. In the :guilabel:`Pay` pop-up window, select "
"a :guilabel:`Journal` and click :guilabel:`Create Payment`."
msgstr ""
"Hvis alle detaljer er korrekte på fakturakladden, klik "
"enten :guilabel:`Bekræft` og klik :guilabel:`Send` for at sende fakturaen "
"til kunden via e-mail, eller klik :guilabel:`Udskriv` og derefter "
"klik :guilabel:`Betal`, hvis kunden er til stede. I pop op-"
"vinduet :guilabel:`Betal`, vælg en :guilabel:`Journal` og "
"klik :guilabel:`Opret betaling`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/create_rental_order.rst:194
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Payments` smart button that appears at the top of the "
