#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:5
msgid ""
"Requiring fixed deposits is common in many rental scenarios, such as "
"collecting security deposits. Security deposits are insurance in case of "
"damage, theft, or unpaid fees. It is typically refunded when the rented "
"product is returned in good condition, and all terms of the rental or "
"service agreement are met."
msgstr ""
"Krav om faste depositummer er almindeligt i mange udlejningsscenarier, "
"f.eks. ved opkrævning af depositum som sikkerhedsstillelse. Et "
"sikkerhedsdepositum fungerer som en forsikring i tilfælde af skader, tyveri "
"eller ubetalte gebyrer. Det refunderes typisk, når det lejede produkt "
"returneres i god stand, og alle betingelser i leje- eller serviceaftalen er "
"opfyldt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:10
msgid ""
"This document covers the standard options for :ref:`configuring <rental/"
"rental_order/manage_deposits/config>`, :ref:`collecting <rental/"
"rental_orders/manage_deposits/optional-product>`, and :ref:`refunding "
"<rental/rental_order/manage_deposits/refund>` deposits within the "
"**Rentals** app."
msgstr ""
"Dette dokument dækker standardmulighederne for :ref:`konfiguration <rental/"
"rental_order/manage_deposits/config>`, :ref:`opkrævning <rental/"
"rental_orders/manage_deposits/optional-product>` og :ref:`refusion <rental/"
"rental_order/manage_deposits/refund>` af depositummer i appen **Udlejning**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:18
msgid ""
"The following apps are essential for configuring deposit service products "
"and processing deposit refunds:"
msgstr ""
"Følgende apps er nødvendige for at konfigurere depositumsserviceprodukter og "
"behandle depositumsrefusioner:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Sales**: Enables the *Price* tab on product forms when :doc:`../../sales/"
"products_prices/prices` is enabled. Also enables the use of quotation "
"templates."
msgstr ""
"**Salg**: Aktiverer fanen *Pris* på produktformularer, når :doc:`../../sales/"
"products_prices/prices` er aktiveret. Gør det også muligt at bruge "
"tilbudsskabeloner."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:23
msgid ""
"**Accounting**: Enables the use of :doc:`Credit Notes <../../../finance/"
"accounting/customer_invoices/credit_notes>` on rental orders, which are "
"required when returning a deposit."
msgstr ""
"**Regnskab**: Gør det muligt at bruge :doc:`kreditnotaer <../../../finance/"
"accounting/customer_invoices/credit_notes>` på lejeordrer, hvilket er "
"påkrævet ved returnering af et depositum."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:32
msgid ""
"For every rental product that requires a deposit, a second product **must** "
"be configured specifically for the deposit."
msgstr ""
"For hvert udlejningsprodukt, der kræver et depositum, **skal** der "
"konfigureres et andet produkt specifikt til depositummet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:36
msgid ""
"When configuring a digital camera rental that requires a deposit, two "
"products must be configured: `Digital Camera Rental` and `Digital Camera "
"Rental Deposit` products."
msgstr ""
"Ved konfiguration af leje af et digitalkamera, der kræver depositum, skal "
"der konfigureres to produkter: produkterne `Udlejning af digitalkamera` og "
"`Depositum for udlejning af digitalkamera`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:40
msgid ""
"Including the product name within the deposit service product name improves "
"organizational clarity and simplifies deposit tracking."
msgstr ""
"At inkludere produktnavnet i navnet på depositum-serviceproduktet forbedrer "
"overskueligheden og forenkler sporingen af depositummer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:43
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Rental --> Products --> Products`, "
"click :guilabel:`New`, and clearly name the service product as a deposit."
msgstr ""
"Gå til :menuselection:`Udlejning --> Produkter --> Produkter`, klik "
"på :guilabel:`Ny`, og navngiv serviceproduktet tydeligt som et depositum."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:46
msgid ""
"Next, set the :guilabel:`Product Type` to :guilabel:`Service`, "
"the :guilabel:`Invoicing Policy` to :guilabel:`Based on Delivered Quantity "
"(Manual)`, and :guilabel:`Sales Price` to the desired deposit amount, and "
"the unit of measure to :guilabel:`Units`."
msgstr ""
"Indstil derefter :guilabel:`Produkttype` "
"til :guilabel:`Ydelse`, :guilabel:`Faktureringspolitik` "
"til :guilabel:`Baseret på leveret mængde (manuelt)` og :guilabel:`Salgspris` "
"til det ønskede depositumbeløb og måleenheden til :guilabel:`Enheder`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:50
msgid ""
"Choose whether to include :ref:`Sales Taxes <taxes/product>` for the deposit "
"service product. Finally, :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` :guilabel:`(save)` the "
"deposit service product."
msgstr ""
"Vælg, om der skal medregnes :ref:`Salgsmoms <taxes/product>` for depositum-"
"serviceproduktet. :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` :guilabel:`(gem)` til sidst "
"depositum-serviceproduktet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:53
msgid ""
"Rental product form configured as a digital camera deposit service in the "
"Rental app."
msgstr ""
"Udlejningsproduktformular konfigureret som en depositum-serviceydelse for et "
"digitalkamera i appen Udlejning."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:59
msgid "Add a deposit to a rental order"
msgstr "Føj et depositum til en udlejningsordre"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:61
msgid ""
"There are several methods to add a deposit service product to a rental "
"order, alongside the related product:"
msgstr ""
"Der er flere måder at føje et depositum-serviceprodukt til en "
"udlejningsordre sammen med det tilhørende produkt:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:64
msgid ""
":ref:`Optional product menu <rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits/optional-"
"product>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Valgfri produktmenu <rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits/optional-"
"product>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:65
msgid ""
":ref:`Quotation template <rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits/use-quotation-"
"template>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Tilbudsskabelon <rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits/use-quotation-"
"template>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:66
msgid ":doc:`Manually <create_rental_order>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Manuelt <create_rental_order>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:71
msgid "Optional product menu"
msgstr "Valgfri produktmenu"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:73
msgid ""
"To :ref:`configure an optional product <sales/sales_quotations/config-"
"optional-product>` for a deposit, select the desired product or create one. "
"On the product's form, click the :guilabel:`Sales` tab and add the product "
"configured as the deposit to the :guilabel:`Optional Products` field in the "
"*Upsell & Cross-sell* section."
msgstr ""
"For at :ref:`konfigurere et valgfrit produkt <sales/sales_quotations/config-"
"optional-product>` til et depositum skal du vælge det ønskede produkt eller "
"oprette et. På produktformularen skal du klikke på fanen :guilabel:`Salg` og "
"tilføje det produkt, der er konfigureret som depositum, i "
"feltet :guilabel:`Valgfrie produkter` under afsnittet *Mersalg og krydssalg*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:79
msgid ""
"If :ref:`creating a new product <rental/physical-products>`, be sure to "
"configure the rental product's prices on the :guilabel:`Prices` tab."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du :ref:`opretter et nyt produkt <rental/physical-products>`, skal du "
"sørge for at konfigurere udlejningsproduktets priser på "
"fanen :guilabel:`Priser`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:82
msgid ""
"A Digital Camera rental product form with an Optional Product field "
"configured to\n"
"its deposit."
msgstr ""
"En produktformular til udlejning af et digitalkamera med et felt til "
"valgfrie produkter konfigureret til\n"
"dets depositum."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:86
msgid ""
"Then :doc:`create_rental_order` and add the rental product in "
"the :guilabel:`Order Lines` tab. A *Configure your product* pop-up window "
"appears. Click :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Add`, for the deposit item, then "
"click :guilabel:`Confirm`."
msgstr ""
"Gennemfør derefter :doc:`create_rental_order` og tilføj udlejningsproduktet "
"under fanen :guilabel:`Ordrelinjer`. Pop op-vinduet *Konfigurer dit produkt* "
"vises. Klik på :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Tilføj` for depositumvaren, og "
"klik derefter på :guilabel:`Bekræft`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:91
msgid ""
"If :doc:`eCommerce <../../../websites/ecommerce>` is installed, add "
"a :guilabel:`Short Description` to the rental product's :guilabel:`Sales` "
"tab stating a deposit is required."
msgstr ""
"Hvis :doc:`e-Handel <../../../websites/ecommerce>` er installeret, skal du "
"tilføje en :guilabel:`Kort beskrivelse` på udlejningsproduktets "
"fane :guilabel:`Salg`, der angiver, at der kræves et depositum."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:94
msgid ""
"When a customer adds the rental product to their cart, a *Configure* pop-up "
"window displays the deposit service product under :guilabel:`Available "
"options`."
msgstr ""
"Når en kunde føjer udlejningsproduktet til sin indkøbskurv, viser et "
"*Konfigurer*-pop op-vindue depositum-serviceproduktet "
"under :guilabel:`Tilgængelige muligheder`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:97
msgid ""
"Once the customer clicks :icon:`fa-shopping-cart` :guilabel:`Add to Cart`, "
"the rental product and the deposit service product are added to their cart."
msgstr ""
"Når kunden klikker :icon:`fa-shopping-cart` :guilabel:`Tilføj`, tilføjes "
"lejeproduktet og depositumserviceproduktet til deres indkøbskurv."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:100
msgid "A Configure your product window for a Digital Camera and its deposit."
msgstr ""
"Et vindue til Konfigurer dit produkt for et digitalkamera og dets depositum."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:106
msgid "Quotation template"
msgstr "Tilbudsskabelon"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:108
msgid ""
"Using quotation templates helps tailor the product list to the customer "
"while ensuring the necessary deposits are included in the order. Navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Rental app --> Configuration --> Quotation Templates` and "
"click :guilabel:`New` to get started."
msgstr ""
"Brug af tilbudsskabeloner hjælper med at tilpasse produktlisten til kunden "
"og samtidig sikre, at de nødvendige deposita inkluderes i ordren. Naviger "
"til :menuselection:`Udlejningsapp --> Konfiguration --> Tilbudsskabeloner` "
"og klik på :guilabel:`Ny` for at komme i gang."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:112
msgid ""
":ref:`Create a quotation template <sales/quote_template/create_templates>` "
"that includes both the rental product and the rental product deposit, and "
"save the template. Next, create a :doc:`create_rental_order`. Select the "
"desired template in the :guilabel:`Quotation Template` field."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Opret en tilbudsskabelon <sales/quote_template/create_templates>`, der "
"indeholder både udlejningsproduktet og udlejningsproduktets depositum, og "
"gem skabelonen. Opret derefter en :doc:`create_rental_order`. Vælg den "
"ønskede skabelon i feltet :guilabel:`Tilbudsskabelon`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:117
msgid "Process a deposit on a rental order"
msgstr "Behandl et depositum på en udlejningsordre"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:119
msgid ""
"Once the rental order is confirmed by the customer, the deposit should be "
"invoiced either before or at the time the customer picks up the rented "
"product."
msgstr ""
"Når udlejningsordren er bekræftet af kunden, bør depositummet faktureres "
"enten før eller på det tidspunkt, hvor kunden afhenter det lejede produkt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:122
msgid ""
"To do so, change the :guilabel:`Delivered` column for the deposit service "
"product to `1`. The text color changes from black to blue, indicating that "
"the line is ready for invoicing."
msgstr ""
"For at gøre dette skal du ændre kolonnen :guilabel:`Leveret` for "
"depositumserviceproduktet til `1`. Tekstfarven skifter fra sort til blå, "
"hvilket angiver, at linjen er klar til fakturering."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:125
msgid ""
"Digital Camera Deposit on a rental order with the Delivered column set to 1."
msgstr ""
"Depositum for digitalkamera på en udlejningsordre med kolonnen Leveret sat "
"til 1."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:128
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Create Invoice` and select :guilabel:`Regular invoice` from "
"the *Create invoice(s)* pop-up window. Click :guilabel:`Create Draft` to "
"generate the invoice. After verifying that the draft is correct, "
"click :guilabel:`Confirm`, then click :guilabel:`Send` to email the invoice "
"to the customer."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :guilabel:`Opret faktura` og vælg :guilabel:`Almindelig faktura` i "
"pop op-vinduet *Opret faktura(er)*. Klik på :guilabel:`Opret kladde` for at "
"oprette fakturaen. Når du har kontrolleret, at kladden er korrekt, skal du "
"klikke på :guilabel:`Bekræft` og derefter klikke på :guilabel:`Send` for at "
"sende fakturaen til kunden via e-mail."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:133
msgid "A confirmed invoice for a rental deposit."
msgstr "En bekræftet faktura for et udlejningsdepositum."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:136
msgid ""
"For in-person transactions, click :guilabel:`Pay`, verify the *Pay* pop-up "
"window, then click :guilabel:`Create Payment` and click :guilabel:`Send` to "
"email a copy of the receipt."
msgstr ""
"Ved personlige transaktioner skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Betal`, "
"kontrollere pop op-vinduet *Betal*, klikke på :guilabel:`Opret betaling` og "
"klikke på :guilabel:`Send` for at sende en kopi af kvitteringen via e-mail."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:142
msgid "Refund deposits upon return"
msgstr "Refunder depositum ved returnering"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:144
msgid ""
"To process a deposit return, the **Accounting** app must be installed. After "
"a customer :ref:`returns the rented item <rental/pickup_return/return>`, "
"begin the deposit return by preparing a :doc:`credit note <../../../finance/"
"accounting/customer_invoices/credit_notes>` against the original deposit "
"invoice."
msgstr ""
"For at behandle en tilbagebetaling af depositum skal appen **Regnskab** være "
"installeret. Når en kunde :ref:`returnerer den lejede vare <rental/"
"pickup_return/return>`, påbegyndes tilbagebetalingen af depositummet ved at "
"oprette en :doc:`kreditnota <../../../finance/accounting/customer_invoices/"
"credit_notes>` mod den oprindelige depositumfaktura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:149
msgid ""
"First, go to the :menuselection:`Rental app --> Orders --> Orders`, and "
"select the correct rental order. Click the :icon:`fa-pencil-square-"
"o` :guilabel:`Invoices` smart button, find the invoice for the deposit, "
"and :ref:`issue a credit note <accounting/credit_notes/issue-credit-note>`."
msgstr ""
"Gå først til :menuselection:`Udlejningsapp --> Ordrer --> Ordrer`, og vælg "
"den korrekte udlejningsordre. Klik på smart-knappen :icon:`fa-pencil-square-"
"o` :guilabel:`Fakturaer`, find fakturaen for depositummet, og :ref:`udsted "
"en kreditnota <accounting/credit_notes/issue-credit-note>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:153
msgid "A paid deposit invoice to show the Credit Note button."
msgstr "En betalt depositumfaktura, der viser knappen Kreditnota."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:157
msgid ""
"When creating a credit note, enter `Security Deposit Refund` in "
"the :guilabel:`Reason displayed on Credit Note` field in the *Credit Note* "
"pop-up window."
msgstr ""
"Når du opretter en kreditnota, skal du indtaste `Security Deposit Refund` i "
"feltet :guilabel:`Begrundelse vist på kreditnota` i pop op-vinduet "
"*Kreditnota*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:160
msgid ""
"Credit Note pop-up window with Security Deposit Refund entered in the Reason "
"field."
msgstr ""
"Pop op-vinduet Kreditnota med Security Deposit Refund indtastet i feltet "
"Begrundelse."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:163
msgid ""
"Return to the rental order using the :icon:`fa-pencil-square-"
"o` :guilabel:`Sales Orders` smart button. For the deposit order line, change "
"the :guilabel:`Delivered` quantity from `1` to `0`. This step ensures the "
"deposit is marked as returned."
msgstr ""
"Vend tilbage til udlejningsordren ved hjælp af smart-knappen :icon:`fa-"
"pencil-square-o` :guilabel:`Salgsordrer`. På ordrelinjen for depositum skal "
"du ændre antallet :guilabel:`Leveret` fra `1` til `0`. Dette trin sikrer, at "
"depositummet markeres som returneret."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:167
msgid ""
"Then, review any rental refunds due before creating a final invoice for the "
"remaining charges by clicking :guilabel:`Create Invoice`."
msgstr ""
"Gennemgå derefter eventuelle forfaldne udlejningsrefusioner, før der "
"oprettes en endelig faktura for de resterende gebyrer ved at klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Opret faktura`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:170
msgid ""
"In the draft invoice, the deposit line will appear as a negative amount, "
"which shows the amount to refund. At the bottom, review "
"the :guilabel:`Outstanding Credits` section for the credit note created for "
"the deposit refund."
msgstr ""
"På fakturakladden vises depositumlinjen som et negativt beløb, hvilket "
"angiver det beløb, der skal refunderes. Nederst gennemgås "
"afsnittet :guilabel:`Udestående kreditter` for den kreditnota, der er "
"oprettet til tilbagebetaling af depositum."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:174
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Add` to apply these credits to the invoice. This completes "
"the refund process."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :guilabel:`Tilføj` for at anvende disse kreditter på fakturaen. "
"Dette fuldfører refusionsprocessen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:176
msgid "A invoice for a rental order with outstanding credits."
msgstr "En faktura for en lejeordre med udestående tilgodehavender."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:180
msgid "Invoice the remaining rental charges"
msgstr "Fakturer de resterende lejegebyrer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:182
msgid ""
"On the new invoice draft, the :guilabel:`Total` amount displays the applied "
"credit note amount and deposit date. After verifying the totals, "
"click :guilabel:`Confirm` to finalize the invoice."
msgstr ""
"På den nye fakturakladde viser beløbet :guilabel:`Total` det anvendte "
"kreditnotabeløb og depositumsdatoen. Når totalerne er kontrolleret, skal du "
"klikke på :guilabel:`Bekræft` for at færdiggøre fakturaen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:185
msgid "Sample of a invoice for a rental order with an applied credit note."
msgstr "Eksempel på en faktura for en lejeordre med en anvendt kreditnota."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/manage_deposits.rst:188
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Send` to email the final invoice to the customer. For in-"
"person transactions, click :guilabel:`Pay` to process the payment."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :guilabel:`Send` for at sende den endelige faktura pr. e-mail til "
"kunden. Ved personlige transaktioner skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Betal` for "
"at behandle betalingen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:-1
msgid ""
"This document explains how to pick up and return rental Goods (physical "
"products) and Services."
msgstr ""
"Dette dokument forklarer, hvordan man afhenter og returnerer lejede varer "
"(fysiske produkter) og tjenester."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:13
msgid ""
"This document focuses on the pickup and return of both rental *Goods* "
"(physical products) such as clothes, computer equipment, bicycles, and "
"*Services* (physical and non-physical) such as photographer sessions, hotel "
"rooms, and catering. Refer to the :doc:`../configure_products/product_type` "
"page for more information on *Goods* and *Services*."
msgstr ""
"Dette dokument fokuserer på afhentning og returnering af både udlejnings-"
"*varer* (fysiske produkter) såsom tøj, computerudstyr, cykler og "
"-*tjenester* (fysiske og ikke-fysiske) såsom fotografsessioner, "
"hotelværelser og catering. Se siden :doc:`../configure_products/"
"product_type` for at få flere oplysninger om *varer* og *tjenester*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:18
msgid ""
"Once a rental order is confirmed, the reserved rental products are available "
"for pickup. If company policy requires a signed rental contract, it is "
"recommended to :ref:`request the customer's signature <rental/"
"create_rental_order/customer-signature>` before the rental product is picked "
"up."
msgstr ""
"Når en lejeordre er bekræftet, er de reserverede udlejningsprodukter klar "
"til afhentning. Hvis virksomhedens politik kræver en underskrevet "
"lejekontrakt, anbefales det at :ref:`anmode om kundens underskrift <rental/"
"create_rental_order/customer-signature>`, før udlejningsproduktet afhentes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:27
msgid "Two basic configurations cover the rental product types:"
msgstr "To grundlæggende konfigurationer dækker udlejningsprodukttyperne:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:29
msgid ":ref:`rental/pickup_return/physical-rental-products`"
msgstr ":ref:`rental/pickup_return/physical-rental-products`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:30
msgid ":ref:`rental/pickup_return/service-rental-products`"
msgstr ":ref:`rental/pickup_return/service-rental-products`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:37
msgid ""
"Configuration for physical rental products requires that the **Rental**, "
"**Inventory**, and **Sales** apps are installed. If product tracking is "
"required, go to :menuselection:`Inventory app --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`. In the *Traceability* section, enable the :guilabel:`Lots & "
"Serial Numbers` checkbox. Then :ref:`configure product tracking <rental/"
"products/product-tracking>` on the rental product form."
msgstr ""
"Konfiguration for fysiske udlejningsprodukter kræver, at appsene "
"**Udlejning**, **Lager** og **Salg** er installeret. Hvis produktsporing er "
"påkrævet, skal du gå til :menuselection:`Lager-app --> Konfiguration --> "
"Indstillinger`. I afsnittet *Sporbarhed* aktiveres "
"afkrydsningsfeltet :guilabel:`Parti- & serienumre`. Derefter skal "
"du :ref:`konfigurere produktsporing <rental/products/product-tracking>` på "
"udlejningsproduktets formular."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:46
msgid "Service rental products"
msgstr "Lejeprodukter for tjenester"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:48
msgid ""
"Configuration for service rental products, both physical and non-physical, "
"requires the **Rental**, **Planning**, and **Sales** apps to be installed. "
"For physical service products, :ref:`configure the materials and roles "
"<rental/service_products/materials-and-roles>` in the **Planning** app "
"before creating the product."
msgstr ""
"Konfiguration for serviceudlejningsprodukter, både fysiske og ikke-fysiske, "
"kræver, at appsene **Udlejning**, **Planlægning** og **Salg** er "
"installeret. For fysiske serviceprodukter skal du :ref:`konfigurere "
"materialerne og rollerne <rental/service_products/materials-and-roles>` i "
"appen **Planlægning**, før produktet oprettes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:53
msgid ""
"For non-physical service products, :ref:`configure employee roles <rental/"
"labor_service_products/configure-employee-roles>` in the **Planning** app "
"before creating the product."
msgstr ""
"For ikke-fysiske serviceprodukter skal du :ref:`konfigurere "
"medarbejderroller <rental/labor_service_products/configure-employee-roles>` "
"i appen **Planlægning**, før produktet oprettes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:60
msgid "Configure pick up and return availability for eCommerce products"
msgstr ""
"Konfigurer tilgængelighed for afhentning og returnering for eCommerce-"
"produkter"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:62
msgid ""
"The **Rental** app supports eCommerce configuration at :ref:`the company "
"<rental/product_type/configuration>` and product level when the **Website** "
"app and the **eCommerce** module are installed. Using the *Availabilities* "
"setting restricts the days and times the company allows pickups and returns "
"to be scheduled through the online store. To configure the rental product "
"page in the online store, refer to the :ref:`Product configuration "
"<ecommerce/products/product-configuration>` section for the **eCommerce** "
"module."
msgstr ""
"Appen **Udlejning** understøtter eCommerce-konfiguration "
"på :ref:`virksomheds- <rental/product_type/configuration>` og produktniveau, "
"når appen **Websted** og modulet **eCommerce** er installeret. Indstillingen "
"*Tilgængelighed* begrænser de dage og tidspunkter, hvor virksomheden "
"tillader afhentninger og returneringer planlagt via webshoppen. For at "
"konfigurere udlejningsproduktsiden i webshoppen henvises der til "
"afsnittet :ref:`Produktkonfiguration <ecommerce/products/product-"
"configuration>` for **eCommerce**-modulet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:72
msgid "Pick up a rental product"
msgstr "Afhent et udlejningsprodukt"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:75
msgid ""
"For rental businesses that rent out locations with no stock movement, such "
"as hotel rooms, meeting rooms, and storage spaces, the pickup (check-in) and "
"return (check-out) processes are the same."
msgstr ""
"For udlejningsvirksomheder, der udlejer lokationer uden lagerbevægelse, "
"såsom hotelværelser, mødelokaler og opbevaringsrum, er processerne for "
"afhentning (tjek ind) og returnering (tjek ud) de samme."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:79
msgid ""
"To process a pickup of a rental product, go to :menuselection:`Rental app --"
"> Orders --> Orders` and select the desired rental order. "
"Click :guilabel:`Pickup`, and a *Validate a pickup* pop-up window displays, "
"listing the reserved rental product and quantity "
"in :guilabel:`Product`, :guilabel:`Reserved`, and :guilabel:`Picked-up` "
"columns."
msgstr ""
"For at behandle en afhentning af et udlejningsprodukt skal du gå "
"til :menuselection:`Udlejning-app --> Ordrer --> Ordrer` og vælge den "
"ønskede lejeordre. Klik på :guilabel:`Afhent`, og et pop op-vindue *Bekræft "
"en afhentning* vises med en oversigt over det reserverede udlejningsprodukt "
"og mængde i kolonnerne :guilabel:`Produkt`, :guilabel:`Reserveret` "
"og :guilabel:`Afhentet`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:84
msgid "Example of a Validate a pickup page in the Rental app."
msgstr "Eksempel på en Bekræft en afhentning-side i appen Udlejning."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:87
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:114
msgid ""
"To confirm the list, click :guilabel:`Validate`. The action updates the "
"rental order with a :guilabel:`Picked-up` badge and updates "
"the :guilabel:`Delivered` column. The action is also recorded in the rental "
"order's chatter."
msgstr ""
"For at bekræfte listen skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Valider`. Handlingen "
"opdaterer lejeordren med et :guilabel:`Afhentet`-badge og opdaterer "
"kolonnen :guilabel:`Leveret`. Handlingen registreres også i lejeordrens "
"chatter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:91
msgid ""
"Example of a rental order once the rental product is picked up in the Rental "
"app."
msgstr ""
"Eksempel på en lejeordre, når lejeproduktet er afhentet i Udlejning-appen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:97
msgid "Pick up a physical rental product with tracking enabled"
msgstr "Afhent et fysisk lejeprodukt med aktiveret sporing"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:100
msgid ""
"This process requires that the *Lots & Serial Numbers* feature in the "
"**Inventory** app be enabled and that the *Tracking* field be set to *By "
"Unique Serial Number* on the rental product form."
msgstr ""
"Denne proces kræver, at funktionen *Parti- og serienumre* i **Lager**-appen "
"er aktiveret, og at feltet *Sporing* er angivet til *Efter unikt "
"serienummer* på lejeproduktformularen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:104
msgid ""
"To process a pickup of a physical rental product with tracking enabled, go "
"to :menuselection:`Rental app --> Orders --> Orders` and select the desired "
"rental order. Click :guilabel:`Pickup`, and the *Validate a pickup* pop-up "
"window displays, listing the reserved rental product and quantity "
"in :guilabel:`Product`, :guilabel:`Reserved`, :guilabel:`Serial Numbers`, "
"and :guilabel:`Picked-up` columns. Check the rental product's serial number "
"and then click in the :guilabel:`Serial Numbers` column and select the "
"product's serial number from the drop-down list."
msgstr ""
"For at behandle en afhentning af et fysisk lejeprodukt med aktiveret sporing "
"skal du gå til :menuselection:`Udlejning-app --> Ordrer --> Ordrer` og vælge "
"den ønskede lejeordre. Klik på :guilabel:`Afhent`, hvorefter pop op-vinduet "
"*Valider en afhentning* vises med det reserverede lejeprodukt og antal i "
"kolonnerne :guilabel:`Produkt`, :guilabel:`Reserveret`, :guilabel:`Serienumre` "
"og :guilabel:`Afhentet`. Kontroller lejeproduktets serienummer, klik "
"derefter i kolonnen :guilabel:`Serienumre`, og vælg produktets serienummer "
"fra rullelisten."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:111
msgid ""
"Example of a Validate a pickup page with product tracking enabled in the "
"Rental app."
msgstr ""
"Eksempel på siden Valider en afhentning med produktsporing aktiveret i "
"Udlejning-appen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:118
msgid "Example of a rental order with a Picked-up badge in the Rental app."
msgstr "Eksempel på en lejeordre med et Afhentet-badge i Udlejning-appen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:124
msgid "Pick up a rental product and a rental service"
msgstr "Afhent et lejeprodukt og en lejetjeneste"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:127
msgid ""
"Refer to the :ref:`physical and service rental configuration requirements "
"<rental/pickup_return/configuration>` to see the necessary app installations "
"and settings."
msgstr ""
"Se :ref:`konfigurationskravene til fysisk udlejning og serviceudlejning "
"<rental/pickup_return/configuration>` for at se de nødvendige app-"
"installationer og indstillinger."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:130
msgid ""
"When a physical rental product is rented alongside a service, it is advised "
"to pick it up before :ref:`entering time on the employee shift <rental/"
"create_rental_order/time-for-employee-shift>`, if applicable."
msgstr ""
"Når et fysisk udlejningsprodukt lejes sammen med en serviceydelse, tilrådes "
"det at afhente det før :ref:`registrering af tid på medarbejdervagten "
"<rental/create_rental_order/time-for-employee-shift>`, hvis relevant."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:137
msgid "Return a rental product"
msgstr "Returner et lejeprodukt"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:140
msgid ""
"Regardless of whether a physical rental product is rented along with a "
"service rental product, both must be returned on the rental order. Returning "
"a rental service is the same process as returning a physical rental product "
"without tracking enabled."
msgstr ""
"Uanset om et fysisk lejeprodukt lejes sammen med en lejetjeneste eller ej, "
"skal begge returneres på lejeordren. Returnering af en lejetjeneste følger "
"samme proces som returnering af et fysisk lejeprodukt uden aktiveret sporing."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:144
msgid ""
"When a customer returns the rental product, go to :menuselection:`Rental app "
"--> Orders --> Orders` and select the desired rental order. "
"Click :guilabel:`Return`, and the *Validate a return* pop-up window "
"displays, listing the returning rental product and quantity "
"in :guilabel:`Product`, :guilabel:`Picked-up`, and :guilabel:`Returned` "
"columns."
msgstr ""
"Når en kunde returnerer lejeproduktet, skal du gå "
"til :menuselection:`Udlejning-app --> Ordrer --> Ordrer` og vælge den "
"ønskede lejeordre. Klik på :guilabel:`Returner`, hvorefter pop op-vinduet "
"*Valider en returnering* vises med det returnerede lejeprodukt og antal i "
"kolonnerne :guilabel:`Produkt`, :guilabel:`Afhentet` "
"og :guilabel:`Returneret`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:149
msgid "Example of a Validate a return page in the Rental app."
msgstr "Eksempel på siden Valider en returnering i Udlejning-appen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:152
msgid ""
"To confirm the list, click :guilabel:`Validate`. The action applies "
"a :guilabel:`Returned` badge to the rental order and updates "
"the :guilabel:`Returned` column. The action is also recorded in the rental "
"order's chatter."
msgstr ""
"For at bekræfte listen skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Valider`. Handlingen "
"tildeler et :guilabel:`Returneret`-badge til lejeordren og opdaterer "
"kolonnen :guilabel:`Returneret`. Handlingen registreres også i lejeordrens "
"chatter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/pickup_return.rst:156
