#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:49
msgid ""
"To enable accurate tracking, create a product kit for the existing Amazon "
"product. When a new |FBA| order syncs, Odoo sells the kit, which prevents "
"the error that occurs with the tracked product."
msgstr ""
"For at muliggøre nøjagtig sporing skal du oprette et produktkit for det "
"eksisterende Amazon-produkt. Når en ny |FBA|-ordre synkroniseres, sælger "
"Odoo kittet, hvilket forhindrer fejlen, der opstår med det sporede produkt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:52
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Products --> Products` and "
"click :guilabel:`New`. Then, :ref:`create a kit as a product <manufacturing/"
"advanced_configuration/kits>` that represents the Amazon item."
msgstr ""
"Naviger til :menuselection:`Salg-app --> Produkter --> Produkter` og klik "
"på :guilabel:`Ny`. :ref:`Opret derefter et kit som et produkt <manufacturing/"
"advanced_configuration/kits>`, der repræsenterer Amazon-varen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:57
msgid "*Never* enable :guilabel:`Track Inventory` for the product kit."
msgstr "Aktivér *aldrig* :guilabel:`Spor lager` for produktkittet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:59
msgid "Example of a product form configured to be a kit in the Inventory app."
msgstr ""
"Eksempel på en produktformular konfigureret til at være et kit i Lager-appen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:65
msgid "Link the Amazon item SKU to the product kit"
msgstr "Link Amazon-varens SKU til produktkittet"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:67
msgid ""
"Next, go to the :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Offers` and "
"click :guilabel:`New`. Enter the desired :ref:`Amazon market <amazon/"
"supported-marketplaces>` in the :guilabel:`Marketplace` column, and select "
"the product kit in the :guilabel:`Product` column. In the :guilabel:`Amazon "
"SKU` column, enter the SKU of the existing Amazon product."
msgstr ""
"Gå derefter til :menuselection:`Salg-app --> Konfiguration --> Tilbud` og "
"klik på :guilabel:`Ny`. Indtast det ønskede :ref:`Amazon-marked <amazon/"
"supported-marketplaces>` i kolonnen :guilabel:`Markedsplads`, og vælg "
"produktkittet i kolonnen :guilabel:`Produkt`. I kolonnen :guilabel:`Amazon "
"SKU` skal du indtaste SKU'en for det eksisterende Amazon-produkt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:73
msgid ""
"This method removes the link between the Amazon SKU and the tracked product. "
"Breaking this connection is necessary because Odoo cannot automatically "
"assign specific tracking numbers during the sync process."
msgstr ""
"Tato metoda odstraní propojení mezi Amazon SKU a sledovaným produktem. "
"Přerušení tohoto spojení je nezbytné, protože Odoo nemůže během procesu "
"synchronizace automaticky přiřadit konkrétní sledovací čísla."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:77
msgid ""
"Keeping this link active causes a synchronization failure for every |FBA| "
"order. By disconnecting them, the system bypasses the tracking requirement "
"and allows the sync to complete."
msgstr ""
"Ponechání tohoto propojení aktivního způsobuje selhání synchronizace u každé "
"objednávky |FBA|. Odpojením systém obejde požadavek na sledování a umožní "
"dokončení synchronizace."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:80
msgid ""
"Example of a kit product linked to an Amazon SKU in the Offers page in the "
"Sales app."
msgstr ""
"Příklad produktu sady propojeného s Amazon SKU na stránce Nabídky v aplikaci "
"Salg."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:86
msgid "Create the BoM for the product kit"
msgstr "Vytvořit kusovník pro produktovou sadu"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:88
msgid ""
"Navigate to the product kit by clicking the :menuselection:`Sales app --> "
"Products --> Products` and select the product kit. Click the :icon:`fa-"
"flask` :guilabel:`Bill of Materials` smart button and :ref:`create a kit BoM "
"<manufacturing/advanced_configuration/kit-bom>`."
msgstr ""
"Přejděte na produktovou sadu kliknutím na :menuselection:`Salg --> Produkty "
"--> Produkty` a vyberte produktovou sadu. Klikněte na chytré "
"tlačítko :icon:`fa-flask` :guilabel:`Kusovník` a :ref:`vytvořte kusovník "
"sady <manufacturing/advanced_configuration/kit-bom>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:92
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Components` tab, click :guilabel:`Add a line` and type in "
"the name of the Amazon product that is tracked by lots or a unique serial "
"number."
msgstr ""
"Na kartě :guilabel:`Komponenty` klikněte na :guilabel:`Přidat řádek` a "
"zadejte název produktu Amazon, který je sledován pomocí šarží nebo "
"jedinečného sériového čísla."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:96
msgid "The Amazon product must be **the sole component** of the kit BoM."
msgstr "Produkt Amazon musí být **jedinou komponentou** kusovníku sady."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:98
msgid ""
"Example of the kit BoM for the kit product to represent the Amazon listing."
msgstr ""
"Příklad kusovníku sady pro produktovou sadu reprezentující Amazon výpis."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/fba.rst:101
msgid ""
"Now the Amazon product can be processed and tracked accurately in the "
"**Sales** app by using the kit product and its associated BoM."
msgstr ""
"Nyní lze produkt Amazon zpracovat a přesně sledovat v aplikaci **Salg** "
"pomocí produktové sady a souvisejícího kusovníku."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:3
msgid "Amazon Connector features"
msgstr "Funktioner i Forsendelse med Amazon"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:5
msgid ""
"The *Amazon Connector* synchronizes orders between Amazon and Odoo, which "
"considerably reduces the amount of time spent manually entering Amazon "
"orders (from the Amazon Seller account) into Odoo. It also allows users to "
"accurately keep track of Amazon sales in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"*Forsendelse med Amazon* synkroniserer ordrer mellem Amazon og Odoo, hvilket "
"reducerer tiden brugt på manuelt at indtaste Amazon-ordrer (fra Amazon "
"Seller-kontoen) i Odoo betydeligt. Det giver også brugere mulighed for "
"præcist at holde styr på Amazon-salg i Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:10
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/features.rst:11
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/features.rst:10
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/features.rst:10
msgid "Supported features"
msgstr "Understøttede funktioner"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:12
msgid "The Amazon Connector is able to:"
msgstr "Forsendelse med Amazon kan:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:14
msgid ""
"Synchronize (Amazon to Odoo) all confirmed orders (both FBA and FBM), and "
"their order items, which include:"
msgstr ""
"Synkronisere (Amazon til Odoo) alle bekræftede ordrer (både FBA og FBM) og "
"deres ordrelinjer, som inkluderer:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:17
msgid "product name, description, and quantity"
msgstr "produktnavn, beskrivelse og antal"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:18
msgid "shipping costs for the product"
msgstr "forsendelsesomkostninger for produktet"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:19
msgid "gift wrapping charges"
msgstr "gaveindpakningsgebyrer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:21
msgid ""
"Create any missing partner related to an order in Odoo (contact types "
"supported: contact and delivery address)."
msgstr ""
"Oprette eventuelle manglende partnere relateret til en ordre i Odoo "
"(understøttede kontakttyper: kontakt og leveringsadresse)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:24
msgid "Notify Amazon of confirmed shipment in Odoo (FBM) to get paid."
msgstr ""
"Underrette Amazon om bekræftet forsendelse i Odoo (FBM) for at blive betalt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:26
msgid ""
"Synchronize (Odoo to Amazon) all available quantities of your products (FBM)."
msgstr ""
"Synkronisere (Odoo til Amazon) alle tilgængelige mængder af dine produkter "
"(FBM)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:28
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/features.rst:22
msgid "Support multiple seller accounts."
msgstr "Understøt flere sælgerkonti."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:30
msgid "Support multiple marketplaces per seller account."
msgstr "Understøt flere markedspladser pr. sælgerkonto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:32
msgid ""
"The following table lists capabilities provided by Odoo when using the "
"Amazon Connector:"
msgstr ""
"Følgende tabel viser funktioner leveret af Odoo, når du bruger Forsendelse "
"med Amazon:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:35
msgid "Fulfilled By Amazon (FBA)"
msgstr "Fulfilled By Amazon (FBA)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:35
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/features.rst:30
msgid "Fulfilled By Merchant (FBM)"
msgstr "Fulfilled By Merchant (FBM)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:37
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/features.rst:32
msgid "**Orders**"
msgstr "**Ordrer**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:37
msgid "Synchronize shipped and cancelled orders."
msgstr "Synkroniser afsendte og annullerede ordrer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:37
msgid "Synchronize unshipped and cancelled orders."
msgstr "Synkroniser ikke-afsendte og annullerede ordrer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:40
msgid "**Shipping**"
msgstr "**Forsendelse**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:40
msgid ""
"Shipping cost is computed by Amazon, and included in the synchronized order."
msgstr ""
"Forsendelsesomkostninger beregnes af Amazon og inkluderes i den "
"synkroniserede ordre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:40
msgid ""
"Shipping cost is computed by Amazon and included in the synchronized orders."
msgstr ""
"Forsendelsesomkostninger beregnes af Amazon og inkluderes i de "
"synkroniserede ordrer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:44
msgid "Shipping done by Amazon."
msgstr "Forsendelse udført af Amazon."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:44
msgid ""
"A delivery order is automatically created in Odoo for each new order. Once "
"it has been processed in Odoo, the status is then synchronized in Amazon."
msgstr ""
"En leveringsordre oprettes automatisk i Odoo for hver ny ordre. Når den er "
"blevet behandlet i Odoo, synkroniseres status derefter i Amazon."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:50
msgid "**Gift Wrapping**"
msgstr "**Gaveindpakning**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:50
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:61
msgid "Handled by Amazon."
msgstr "Håndteres af Amazon."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:50
msgid ""
"Cost is computed by Amazon, and included in the synchronized order. Gift "
"message is added on a line of the order and on the delivery order. Then it "
"is up to the user."
msgstr ""
"Omkostninger beregnes af Amazon og inkluderes i den synkroniserede ordre. "
"Gavebesked tilføjes på en linje i ordren og på leveringsordren. Derefter er "
"det op til brugeren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:56
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/features.rst:35
msgid "**Stock Management**"
msgstr "**Lagerstyring**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:56
msgid ""
"Managed by Amazon, and synchronized with a virtual location to follow it in "
"Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Håndteres af Amazon og synkroniseres med en virtuel lokation for at følge "
"det i Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:56
msgid "Managed in Odoo Inventory app, and synchronized with Amazon."
msgstr "Håndteres i Odoo Lager-appen og synkroniseres med Amazon."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:61
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/features.rst:40
msgid "**Delivery Notifications**"
msgstr "**Leveringsnotifikationer**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:61
msgid "Send by Amazon, based on delivery status synchronized from Odoo."
msgstr "Sendes af Amazon baseret på leveringsstatus synkroniseret fra Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:66
msgid ""
"The Amazon Connector is designed to synchronize the data of sales orders. "
"Other actions, such as downloading monthly fees reports, handling disputes, "
"or issuing refunds, **must** be managed from the *Amazon Seller Central*, as "
"usual."
msgstr ""
"Forsendelse med Amazon er designet til at synkronisere data fra salgsordrer. "
"Andre handlinger, såsom download af månedlige gebyrrapporter, håndtering af "
"tvister eller udstedelse af kreditnotaer, **skal** håndteres fra *Amazon "
"Seller Central*, som sædvanligt."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/amazon_connector/features.rst:71
msgid ""
"As of February 19, 2024, in North American marketplaces, :abbr:`FBA "
"(Fulfilled by Amazon)` orders created with the *Amazon Connector*, do not "
"get the customer's name passed onto the sales/delivery order in Odoo. This "
"is due to the fact that Amazon now calculates, and remits, sales tax on "
"behalf of sellers. In other words, personally identifiable customer "
"information is not transmitted to the seller any longer, after a :abbr:`FBA "
"(Fulfilled by Amazon)` order."
msgstr ""
"Fra den 19. februar 2024 får :abbr:`FBA (Fulfilled by Amazon)`-ordrer i "
"nordamerikanske markedspladser, der er oprettet med *Forsendelse med "
"Amazon*, ikke kundens navn overført til salgs-/leveringsordren i Odoo. Dette "
"skyldes, at Amazon nu beregner og indbetaler moms på vegne af sælgere. Med "
"andre ord overføres personligt identificerbare kundeoplysninger ikke længere "
"til sælgeren efter en :abbr:`FBA (Fulfilled by Amazon)`-ordre."

