#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:5
msgid ""
"This guide explains how to manage Lazada orders, inventory, deliveries, and "
"sales reporting within Odoo using the **Lazada Connector**. It covers "
"product catalog mapping, order synchronization, delivery processes, and "
"sales analysis to streamline your marketplace operations in Southeast Asia."
msgstr ""
"Denne guide forklarer, hvordan du administrerer Lazada-ordrer, lager, "
"leveringer og salgsrapportering i Odoo ved hjælp af **Lazada Connector**. "
"Den dækker produktkatalogkortlægning, ordresynkronisering, "
"leveringsprocesser og salgsanalyse for at strømline dine "
"markedspladsoperationer i Sydøstasien."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:10
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/manage.rst:6
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:11
msgid "Product catalog mapping"
msgstr "Produktkatalogtilknytning"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:13
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/manage.rst:9
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:18
msgid "New Odoo customers with no existing products"
msgstr "Nye Odoo-kunder uden eksisterende produkter"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:15
msgid ""
"If you are starting a new Odoo database and your products exist only on "
"Lazada, you can import your Lazada product catalog into Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du starter en ny Odoo database, og dine produkter kun eksisterer på "
"Lazada, kan du importere dit Lazada produktkatalog til Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:18
msgid ""
"In `Lazada Seller Center <https://sellercenter.lazada.com.ph/>`_, use "
"the :guilabel:`Bulk Manage` drop-down to export your product catalog, "
"including Lazada SKUs."
msgstr ""
"I `Lazada Seller Center <https://sellercenter.lazada.com.ph/>`_ skal du "
"bruge rullemenuen :guilabel:`Bulk Manage` til at eksportere dit "
"produktkatalog, inklusive Lazada SKU'er."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:23
msgid ""
"Import the exported catalog into Odoo via :menuselection:`Inventory --> "
"Products --> Import`. Map the Lazada SKU to the :guilabel:`Internal "
"Reference` field in Odoo to link your Lazada and Odoo products."
msgstr ""
"Importer det eksporterede katalog til Odoo via :menuselection:`Lager --> "
"Produkter --> Importer`. Kortlæg Lazada SKU til feltet :guilabel:`Intern "
"reference` i Odoo for at forbinde dine Lazada- og Odoo-produkter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:28
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/manage.rst:26
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:32
msgid "Existing Odoo customers with products already in Odoo"
msgstr "Eksisterende Odoo-kunder med produkter allerede i Odoo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:30
msgid ""
"If you have an existing product catalog in Odoo, map your Lazada listings to "
"these products."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du har et eksisterende produktkatalog i Odoo, skal du tilknytte dine "
"Lazada-fortegnelser til disse produkter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:32
msgid ""
"Use the :guilabel:`Sync Product Catalogue` button in Odoo to automatically "
"match active Lazada products."
msgstr ""
"Brug knappen :guilabel:`Synkroniser produktkatalog` i Odoo til automatisk at "
"matche aktive Lazada-produkter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:38
msgid ""
"Product catalog synchronization is an automated process initiated by the "
"synchronization."
msgstr ""
"Produktkatalogsynkronisering er en automatiseret proces, der igangsættes af "
"synkroniseringen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:43
msgid ""
"Orders are automatically fetched from Lazada and synchronized in Odoo at "
"regular intervals (every 60 minutes)."
msgstr ""
"Ordrer hentes automatisk fra Lazada og synkroniseres i Odoo med jævne "
"mellemrum (hver 60. minut)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:46
msgid ""
"Only orders with status :guilabel:`READY_TO_SHIP` or :guilabel:`PROCESSED` "
"are fetched, as these require shipping action."
msgstr ""
"Kun ordrer med status :guilabel:`READY_TO_SHIP` eller :guilabel:`PROCESSED` "
"hentes, da disse kræver forsendelseshandling."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:48
msgid ""
"When an order is canceled on Lazada, its status updates in Odoo. However, "
"cancelling an order in Odoo does not reflect on Lazada."
msgstr ""
"Når en ordre annulleres på Lazada, opdateres dens status i Odoo. Annullering "
"af en ordre i Odoo afspejles dog ikke på Lazada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:50
msgid ""
"For each synchronized order, Odoo creates a sales order and a customer "
"(contact) if the customer has not been previously imported or does not exist "
"in the database."
msgstr ""
"For hver synkroniseret ordre opretter Odoo en salgsordre og en kunde "
"(kontakt), hvis kunden ikke tidligere er blevet importeret eller ikke findes "
"i databasen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:54
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:63
msgid ""
"Only orders requiring shipment are synchronized. Orders with "
"statuses :guilabel:`SHIPPED`, :guilabel:`CANCEL`, :guilabel:`UNPAID`, "
"or :guilabel:`COMPLETED` are excluded during synchronization."
msgstr ""
"Kun ordrer, der kræver forsendelse, synkroniseres. Ordrer med "
"statusser :guilabel:`SHIPPED`, :guilabel:`CANCEL`, :guilabel:`UNPAID` "
"eller :guilabel:`COMPLETED` udelades under synkronisering."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:61
msgid ""
"To synchronize an order whose status hasn't changed since the last "
"synchronization:"
msgstr ""
"Sådan synkroniserer du en ordre, hvis status ikke har ændret sig siden "
"sidste synkronisering:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:63
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Lazada --> "
"Shops`."
msgstr ""
"Naviger til :menuselection:`Salg-appen --> Konfiguration --> Lazada --> "
"Butikker`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:64
msgid ""
"Select the Lazada Shop and modify the :guilabel:`Last Order Sync` date "
"under :guilabel:`Synchronization Information` to a date prior to the order's "
"last status change."
msgstr ""
"Vælg Lazada-shoppen, og ret datoen :guilabel:`Sidste ordresynkronisering` "
"under :guilabel:`Synkroniseringsinformation` til en dato før ordrens sidste "
"statusændring."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:66
msgid "Save to trigger synchronization."
msgstr "Gem for at udløse synkronisering."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:69
msgid ""
"In Debug Mode, access the Lazada shop in Odoo and click :guilabel:`Sync "
"Orders` to immediately synchronize orders or :guilabel:`Sync Inventory` for "
"inventory updates."
msgstr ""
"I fejlretningstilstand skal du åbne Lazada-butikken i Odoo og klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Synkroniser ordrer` for straks at synkronisere ordrer "
"eller :guilabel:`Synkroniser lager` for lageropdateringer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:75
msgid ""
"For :abbr:`FBM (Fulfilled By Merchant)` orders, the **Lazada Connector** "
"creates a picking in the :menuselection:`Inventory` app, along with a sales "
"order and customer record, upon synchronization."
msgstr ""
"For :abbr:`FBM (Fulfilled By Merchant)`-ordrer opretter **Lazada Connector** "
"en plukning i appen :menuselection:`Lager` sammen med en salgsordre og "
"kundepost ved synkronisering."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:78
msgid ""
"Arrange by comfirming the picking in Odoo, then navigate to *Lazada Seller "
"Center* and click :guilabel:`Pack Lazada Package` to generate the tracking "
"number. Odoo retrieves the shipping label and attahces it to the "
"corresponding delivery order."
msgstr ""
"Arranger ved at bekræfte plukningen i Odoo, naviger derefter til *Lazada "
"Seller Center* og klik på :guilabel:`Pak Lazada-pakke` for at generere "
"sporingsnummeret. Odoo henter forsendelsesetiketten og vedhæfter den til den "
"tilsvarende leveringsordre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:81
msgid ""
"Validate the stock movement in Odoo to update inventory levels and confirm "
"the order has left the warehouse."
msgstr ""
"Valider lagerbevægelsen i Odoo for at opdatere lagerniveauer og bekræfte, at "
"ordren har forladt lageret."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:85
msgid "Lazada package statuses"
msgstr "Lazada-pakkestatusser"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:87
msgid ""
"Understanding Lazada package statuses is crucial for effective order "
"management:"
msgstr ""
"Forståelse af Lazada-pakkestatusser er afgørende for effektiv ordrestyring:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:89
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Package Pending on Lazada`: The package is awaiting receipt, "
"tagging, or processing in the warehouse system."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Pakke afventer på Lazada`: Pakken afventer modtagelse, mærkning "
"eller behandling i lagersystemet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:91
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Package Confirmed on Lazada`: The package has been packed by the "
"seller or warehouse and is confirmed ready for courier pickup or dropoff. "
"Lazada is notified and updates the order status."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Pakke bekræftet på Lazada`: Pakken er blevet pakket af sælgeren "
"eller lageret og er bekræftet klar til kurérafhentning eller aflevering. "
"Lazada får besked og opdaterer ordrestatus."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:94
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Ready to Ship on Lazada`: The order is ready for shipment. Lazada "
"is notified and updates the order status."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Klar til forsendelse på Lazada`: Ordren er klar til forsendelse. "
"Lazada får besked og opdaterer ordrestatus."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:96
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Delivered on Lazada`: The parcel has been dropped off or picked "
"up by the logistics provider."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Leveret på Lazada`: Pakken er blevet afleveret eller afhentet af "
"logistikudbyderen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:98
msgid ":guilabel:`Canceled on Lazada`: The order has been canceled."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Annulleret på Lazada`: Ordren er blevet annulleret."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:99
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Manual handling required`: The package cannot be processed on "
"Odoo and requires manual handling on Lazada."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kræver manuel håndtering`: Pakken kan ikke behandles i Odoo og "
"kræver manuel håndtering på Lazada."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:103
msgid ""
"Lazada requires a tracking reference for each delivery. If the carrier "
"doesn't provide one automatically, set it manually in *Lazada Seller "
"Center*. Check supported logistics providers for your region (e.g., "
"Malaysia)."
msgstr ""
"Lazada kræver en sporingsreference for hver levering. Hvis fragtmanden ikke "
"leverer en automatisk, skal du angive den manuelt i *Lazada Seller Center*. "
"Tjek understøttede logistikudbydere for din region (f.eks. Malaysia)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:108
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/manage.rst:130
#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/tiktok_connector/manage.rst:106
msgid "Order fulfillment process"
msgstr "Ordreeksekvering"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:110
msgid ""
"Lazada orders are automatically created in Odoo as sales orders. Select the "
"desired sales order in the **Sales app**."
msgstr ""
"Lazada-ordrer oprettes automatisk i Odoo som salgsordrer. Vælg den ønskede "
"salgsordre i **Salg-appen**."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:112
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Pack Lazada Package` to arrange shipment in the delivery "
"transfer if you are using supported logistics providers. Odoo imports the "
"shipping label (delivery note) and tracking number, associating them with "
"the sales order."
msgstr ""
"Klik på :guilabel:`Pak Lazada-pakke` for at arrangere forsendelse i "
"leveringsoverførslen, hvis du bruger understøttede logistikudbydere. Odoo "
"importerer forsendelsesetiketten (følgeseddel) og sporingsnummer og knytter "
"dem til salgsordren."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:115
msgid "Confirm the stock movement in Odoo to reduce inventory levels."
msgstr "Bekræft lagerbevægelsen i Odoo for at reducere lagerniveauer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:120
msgid ""
"Due to Lazada's policy of not sharing customer email addresses, invoices "
"cannot be sent directly from Odoo. Instead:"
msgstr ""
"På grund af Lazadas politik om ikke at dele kunders e-mailadresser kan "
"fakturaer ikke sendes direkte fra Odoo. I stedet:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:123
msgid ""
"Generate invoices in Odoo and manually upload them to *Lazada Seller Center*."
msgstr ""
"Generer fakturaer i Odoo og upload dem manuelt til *Lazada Seller Center*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:124
msgid "Register Payments:"
msgstr "Registrer betalinger:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:126
msgid ""
"Create a dedicated :guilabel:`Bank Journal` (e.g., \"Lazada Payments\") with "
"a Bank and Cash intermediary account."
msgstr ""
"Opret en dedikeret :guilabel:`Bankjournal` (f.eks. \"Lazada Payments\") med "
"en bank- og kontantmellemkonto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:128
msgid ""
"Since Lazada processes batch payments weekly or monthly, select all invoices "
"linked to a payment in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Da Lazada behandler batchbetalinger ugentligt eller månedligt, skal du vælge "
"alle fakturaer knyttet til en betaling i Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:130
msgid ""
"Use :guilabel:`Batch Deposit` as the Payment Method, select the invoices, "
"and go to :menuselection:`Actions --> Create Batch Payment --> Validate`."
msgstr ""
"Brug :guilabel:`Batch-indbetaling` som betalingsmetode, vælg fakturaerne, og "
"gå til :menuselection:`Handlinger --> Opret batchbetaling --> Valider`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:133
msgid ""
"Reconcile the payments after Lazada deposits the balance. Record it in the "
"bank statement and credit the Lazada intermediary account."
msgstr ""
"Afstem betalingerne, efter Lazada har indbetalt saldoen. Registrer det i "
"bankkontoudtoget og krediter Lazada-mellemkontoen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:137
msgid "Apply the same process for vendor bills related to Lazada commissions."
msgstr ""
"Anvend samme proces for kreditorfakturaer relateret til Lazada-kommissioner."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:140
msgid "Analyzing Lazada sales with Odoo Reporting"
msgstr "Analysere Lazada-salg med Odoo-rapportering"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:142
msgid ""
"Odoo's dashboard consolidates sales data from all channels. To analyze "
"Lazada sales specifically:"
msgstr ""
"Odoos dashboard samler salgsdata fra alle kanaler. Sådan analyserer du "
"Lazada-salg specifikt:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:144
msgid "Set Up Sales Teams:"
msgstr "Opsæt salgsteams:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/manage.rst:146
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Settings --> "
"Connectors --> Lazada --> Shops`."
msgstr ""
"Naviger til :menuselection:`Salg-appen --> Konfiguration --> Indstillinger --"
"> Connectorer --> Lazada --> Butikker`."

