#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:47
msgid ""
"Provide a brief introduction (e.g., \"Integration for Odoo ERP to sync "
"orders, inventory, and fees with Lazada\")."
msgstr ""
"Angiv en kort introduktion (f.eks. \"Integration til Odoo ERP for at "
