msgstr ""
"Hvis godkendelsesstatus afvises, skal du gennemgå årsagen i "
"meddelelsesmailen eller på *Lazada Open Platform Console*. Rediger og "
"indsend igen efter behov."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:57
msgid ""
"Ensure profile details are accurate to avoid delays. Common issues include "
