"načíst objednávky."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:127
msgid "Configure the shop before go-live"
msgstr "Konfigurer butikken før ibrugtagning"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:129
