"Seller Center* (inklusive SKU'er). Importer til Odoo "
"via :menuselection:`Lager-app --> Produkter --> Importer`, og tilknyt SKU'er "
"til feltet :guilabel:`Intern reference`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:152
msgid ""
"For existing Odoo products, export both Lazada and Odoo catalogs, map SKUs "
"to :guilabel:`Internal References` in a spreadsheet, and import the updated "
"mappings back into Odoo."
msgstr ""
"U existujících produktů Odoo exportujte katalogy Lazada i Odoo, namapujte "
"SKU na :guilabel:`interní reference` v tabulce a importujte aktualizovaná "
"mapování zpět do Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/lazada_connector/setup.rst:157
