#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:-1
msgid ""
"Configure discount and loyalty programs in Odoo Sales, Subscriptions, "
"eCommerce, and Point of Sale, including program types, conditional rules, "
"and rewards, to offer customers varied and time-sensitive pricing beyond "
"standard pricelists."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurer rabat- og loyalitetsprogrammer i Odoo Salg, Abonnementer, "
"eCommerce og Point of Sale, herunder programtyper, betingede regler og "
"belønninger, for at tilbyde kunder differentierede og tidsbegrænsede priser "
"ud over standardprislister."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:10
msgid ""
"The Odoo **Sales**, **Subscriptions**, **eCommerce**, and **Point of Sale** "
"applications allow users to create discount and loyalty programs that "
"customers can use for online and in-store shopping. These programs offer "
"more varied, public, and time-sensitive pricing options "
"than :doc:`pricelists </applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/"
"pricing>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo-applikationerne **Salg**, **Abonnementer**, **eCommerce** og **Point of "
"Sale** giver brugere mulighed for at oprette rabat- og loyalitetsprogrammer, "
"som kunder kan bruge til shopping online og i butikker. Disse programmer "
"tilbyder mere varierede, offentlige og tidsbegrænsede prismuligheder "
"end :doc:`prislister </applications/sales/sales/products_prices/prices/"
"pricing>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:18
msgid "Configure the settings"
msgstr "Konfigurer indstillingerne"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:20
msgid ""
"To begin using discount and loyalty programs, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Sales --> Configuration --> Settings`. Under "
"the :guilabel:`Pricing` heading, activate the :guilabel:`Promotions, Loyalty "
"& Gift Card` setting by checking the box next to the feature. Finally, "
"click :guilabel:`Save` to save the changes."
msgstr ""
"For at begynde at bruge rabat- og loyalitetsprogrammer skal du navigere "
"til :menuselection:`Salg --&gt; Konfiguration --&gt; Indstillinger`. Under "
"overskriften :guilabel:`Prissætning` skal du aktivere "
"indstillingen :guilabel:`Kampagner, loyalitet og gavekort` ved at markere "
"afkrydsningsfeltet ud for funktionen. Klik til sidst på :guilabel:`Gem` for "
"at gemme ændringerne."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:28
msgid "Configure discount and loyalty programs"
msgstr "Konfigurer rabat- og loyalitetsprogrammer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:30
msgid ""
"To create discount and loyalty programs, go to :menuselection:`Sales --> "
"Promotions --> Discount & Loyalty`. From this screen, a discount & loyalty "
"program can be created from scratch, or one of seven templates may be chosen "
"as a starting point. Templates include:"
msgstr ""
"For at oprette rabat- og loyalitetsprogrammer skal du gå "
"til :menuselection:`Salg --> Kampagner --> Rabat og loyalitet`. Fra dette "
"skærmbillede kan et rabat- og loyalitetsprogram oprettes helt fra bunden, "
"eller man kan vælge en af syv skabeloner som udgangspunkt. Skabelonerne "
"omfatter:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Promotional Program`: A promotion where a discount of 10% is "
"automatically granted on orders over $50."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kampagneprogram`: En kampagne, hvor der automatisk gives 10 % "
"rabat på ordrer over 50 $."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:36
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Promo Code`: A promotion with a code for 10% off select products."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kampagnekode`: En kampagne med en kode, der giver 10 % rabat på "
"udvalgte produkter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:37
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Buy X, Get Y`: A promotion to buy 2 products and get the 3rd for "
"free."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Køb X, få Y`: En kampagne, hvor kunden køber 2 produkter og får "
"det 3. gratis."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:38
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Next Order Coupon`: A promotion where a coupon with a discount "
"valid on the next purchase is sent after an order is completed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kupon til næste ordre`: En kampagne, hvor en kupon med en rabat, "
"der er gyldig ved næste køb, sendes efter en gennemført ordre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:40
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Loyalty Card`: A promotion where customers earn points with each "
"purchase that can be exchanged for gifts."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Loyalitetskort`: En kampagne, hvor kunder optjener point ved "
"hvert køb, som kan ombyttes til gaver."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:42
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Coupon`: A promotion to generate and share unique coupon codes "
"with customers."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kupon`: En kampagne til at oprette og dele unikke kuponkoder med "
"kunder."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:43
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Fidelity Card`: A promotion where customers who buy 10 products "
"over time get a discount on their 11th purchase."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Stempelkort`: En kampagne, hvor kunder, der køber 10 produkter "
"over tid, får rabat på deres 11. køb."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount.rst:46
msgid ""
"New programs can be created by clicking the :guilabel:`New` button. Existing "
"programs can be edited by selecting them. Creating or editing a program "
"opens the program form."
msgstr ""
"Nye programmer kan oprettes ved at klikke på knappen :guilabel:`Ny`. "
"Eksisterende programmer kan redigeres ved at vælge dem. Oprettelse eller "
"redigering af et program åbner programformularen."

