msgstr ":guilabel:`tax_incl_price`: Pris inkl. moms"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/dynamic_text.rst:208
msgid ""
"When creating a PDF, it's best practice to use common dynamic form fields "
"(:guilabel:`user_id_name`, :guilabel:`partner_id_name`, "
"and :guilabel:`name`). When uploaded into the database, Odoo auto-populates "
"those fields with the information from their respective fields."
msgstr ""
"Når du opretter en PDF, er det bedste praksis at bruge almindelige dynamiske "
"formularfelter (:guilabel:`user_id_name`, :guilabel:`partner_id_name` "
"og :guilabel:`name`). Når de uploades til databasen, udfylder Odoo "
"automatisk disse felter med informationen fra deres respektive felter."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/dynamic_text.rst:212
msgid ""
"In this case, Odoo would auto-populate the Salesperson's name in "
"the :guilabel:`user_id_name` dynamic text field, the Sales Order Reference "
"in the :guilabel:`name` field, and the Customer Name in "
"the :guilabel:`partner_id_name` field."
msgstr ""
"I dette tilfælde ville Odoo automatisk udfylde sælgerens navn i det "
"dynamiske tekstfelt :guilabel:`user_id_name`, salgsorderreferencen i "
"feltet :guilabel:`name` og kundenavnet i feltet :guilabel:`partner_id_name`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/pdf_quote_builder/dynamic_text.rst:216
msgid "PDF quote being built using common dynamic placeholders."
msgstr "PDF-tilbud der bygges ved hjælp af almindelige dynamiske pladsholdere."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:5
msgid "Quotation & section templates"
msgstr "Tilbuds- og sektionsskabeloner"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:7
msgid ""
"Reusable quotation and section templates can be made in Odoo's **Sales** app "
"for common products or services."
msgstr ""
"Genanvendelige tilbuds- og sektionsskabeloner kan oprettes i Odoos **Salg**-"
"app til gængse produkter eller tjenester."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:10
msgid ""
"By using these templates, quotations can be tailored and sent to customers "
"at a quicker pace, without having to create new quotations from scratch "
"every time a sales negotiation occurs."
msgstr ""
"Ved at bruge disse skabeloner kan tilbud tilpasses og sendes til kunder i et "
"hurtigere tempo, uden at skulle oprette nye tilbud fra bunden hver gang en "
"salgsforhandling finder sted."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:16
msgid ""
"To use quotation and section templates, begin by activating the setting "
"in :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Settings`, and scroll to "
"the :guilabel:`Quotations &_Orders` heading."
msgstr ""
"For at bruge tilbudsskabeloner skal du først aktivere indstillingen "
"i :menuselection:`Salg app --> Konfiguration --> Indstillinger` og rulle ned "
"til overskriften :guilabel:`Tilbud & Ordrer`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:19
msgid ""
"Under the heading, tick the :guilabel:`Quotation Templates` checkbox. Doing "
"so reveals a new :guilabel:`Default Template` field, in which a default "
"quotation template can be chosen from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Under overskriften skal du markere "
"afkrydsningsfeltet :guilabel:`Tilbudsskabeloner`. Dette afslører et nyt "
"felt :guilabel:`Standardskabelon`, hvor en standardtilbudsskabelon kan "
"vælges fra rullemenuen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:23
msgid "How to enable quotation templates on Odoo Sales."
msgstr "Sådan aktiverer du tilbudsskabeloner i Odoo Salg."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:26
msgid ""
"Upon activating the :guilabel:`Quotation Templates` feature, an "
"internal :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Quotation Templates` link appears "
"beneath the :guilabel:`Default Template` field."
msgstr ""
"Når funktionen :guilabel:`Tilbudsskabelon` aktiveres, vises et "
"internt :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Tilbudsskabeloner` link under "
"feltet :guilabel:`Standardskabelon`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:29
msgid ""
"Clicking this link reveals the :guilabel:`Templates` page, from which "
"templates can be created, viewed, and edited."
msgstr ""
"Når du klikker på dette link, vises siden :guilabel:`Skabeloner`, hvorfra "
"skabeloner kan oprettes, vises og redigeres."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:32
msgid ""
"Before leaving the :guilabel:`Settings` page, click the :guilabel:`Save` "
"button to save all changes made during the session."
msgstr ""
"Før du forlader siden :guilabel:`Indstillinger`, skal du klikke på "
"knappen :guilabel:`Gem` for at gemme alle ændringer foretaget i sessionen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:38
msgid "Create quotation templates"
msgstr "Opret tilbudsskabeloner"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:40
msgid ""
"To create a quotation template, click the :guilabel:`Quotation Templates` "
"link on the :guilabel:`Settings` page once :guilabel:`Quotation templates` "
"are enabled, or navigate to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> "
"Templates`. Both options reveal the *Templates* page, where quotation "
"templates can be created, viewed, and edited."
msgstr ""
"For at oprette en tilbudsskabelon skal du klikke på "
"linket :guilabel:`Tilbudsskabeloner` på siden :guilabel:`Indstillinger`, "
"når :guilabel:`Tilbudsskabeloner` er aktiveret, eller navigere "
"til :menuselection:`Salg app --> Konfiguration --> Tilbudsskabeloner`. Begge "
"muligheder åbner siden :guilabel:`Tilbudsskabeloner`, hvor tilbudsskabeloner "
"kan oprettes, vises og redigeres."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:45
msgid "Quotation templates page in the Odoo Sales application."
msgstr "Siden Tilbudsskabeloner i Odoo Salg-applikationen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:48
msgid ""
"To create a new quotation template, click the :guilabel:`New` button, "
"located in the upper-left corner. Doing so reveals a blank quotation "
"template form that can be customized."
msgstr ""
"For at oprette en ny tilbudsskabelon skal du klikke på "
"knappen :guilabel:`Ny` i øverste venstre hjørne. Dette åbner en tom "
"tilbudsskabelonformular, der kan tilpasses."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:51
msgid "Create a new quotation template on Odoo Sales."
msgstr "Opret en ny tilbudsskabelon i Odoo Salg."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:54
msgid ""
"Start by entering a name for the template in the :guilabel:`Template` field. "
"If needed, create or select an existing spreadsheet to do complex "
"calculations for the template in the :guilabel:`Quote calculator` field."
msgstr ""
"Start med at indtaste et navn til skabelonen i feltet :guilabel:`Skabelon`. "
"Opret eller vælg om nødvendigt et eksisterende regneark til at udføre "
"komplekse beregninger for skabelonen i feltet :guilabel:`Tilbudsberegner`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:60
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Quote calculator` field is only available for Quotation "
"templates."
msgstr ""
"Feltet :guilabel:`Tilbudsberegner` er kun tilgængeligt for tilbudsskabeloner."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:62
msgid ""
"Enable the :guilabel:`Share` checkbox to make the template accessible to "
"specific sales teams. Select which teams can access it in "
"the :guilabel:`Sales Team` field. If working in a :doc:`multi-company "
"environment <../../../general/companies/multi_company>`, use "
"the :guilabel:`Company` field to designate to which company can access the "
"template."
msgstr ""
"Marker afkrydsningsfeltet :guilabel:`Del` for at gøre skabelonen tilgængelig "
"for specifikke salgsteams. Vælg, hvilke teams der har adgang, i "
"feltet :guilabel:`Salgsteam`. Hvis der arbejdes i et :doc:`miljø med flere "
"virksomheder <../../../general/companies/multi_company>`, skal "
"feltet :guilabel:`Virksomhed` bruges til at angive, hvilken virksomhed der "
"har adgang til skabelonen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:70
msgid "Lines tab"
msgstr "Fanen Linjer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:72
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Lines` tab, products can be added to the quotation "
"template by clicking :guilabel:`Add a product`, organized by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Add a section` (and dragging/dropping section headers), "
"and further explained with discretionary information (such as warranty "
"details, terms, etc.) by clicking :guilabel:`Add a note`."
msgstr ""
"I fanen :guilabel:`Linjer` kan produkter tilføjes til tilbudsskabelonen ved "
"at klikke på :guilabel:`Tilføj et produkt`, organiseres ved at klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Tilføj en sektion` (og trække/slippe sektionsoverskrifter) og "
"forklares yderligere med skønsmæssige oplysninger (såsom garantioplysninger, "
"vilkår osv.) ved at klikke på :guilabel:`Tilføj en note`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:77
msgid ""
"To add a product to a quotation template, click :guilabel:`Add a product` in "
"the :guilabel:`Lines` tab of a quotation template form. Doing so reveals a "
"blank field in the :guilabel:`Product` column."
msgstr ""
"For at tilføje et produkt til en tilbudsskabelon skal du klikke "
"på :guilabel:`Tilføj et produkt` i fanen :guilabel:`Linjer` på en "
"tilbudsskabelonformular. Dette viser et tomt felt i "
"kolonnen :guilabel:`Produkt`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:80
msgid ""
"When clicked, a drop-down menu with existing products in the database "
"appears. Select the desired product from the drop-down menu to add it to the "
"quotation template. If the desired product is not visible, type the name of "
"the desired product in the :guilabel:`Product` field, and the option appears "
"in the drop-down menu. Products can also be found by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Search More...` from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Når der klikkes herpå, vises en rullemenu med eksisterende produkter i "
"databasen. Vælg det ønskede produkt i rullemenuen for at føje det til "
"tilbudsskabelonen. Hvis det ønskede produkt ikke er synligt, skal du "
"indtaste navnet på det ønskede produkt i feltet :guilabel:`Produkt`, "
"hvorefter indstillingen vises i rullemenuen. Produkter kan også findes ved "
"at klikke på :guilabel:`Søg mere...` i rullemenuen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:87
msgid ""
"It is possible to add event-related products (booths and registrations) to "
"quotation templates. To do so, click the :guilabel:`Product` field, type in "
"`Event`, and select the desired event-related product from the resulting "
"drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Det er muligt at tilføje eventrelaterede produkter (stande og tilmeldinger) "
"til tilbudsskabeloner. For at gøre dette skal du klikke på "
"feltet :guilabel:`Produkt`, indtaste `Event` og vælge det ønskede "
"eventrelaterede produkt fra den resulterende rullemenu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:92
msgid ""
"When a product is added to a quotation template, the "
"default :guilabel:`Quantity` is `1`, but that can be edited at any time."
msgstr ""
"Når et produkt tilføjes til en tilbudsskabelon, er standardværdien "
"for :guilabel:`Antal` `1`, men det kan redigeres når som helst."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:95
msgid ""
"Then, drag and drop the product to the desired position, via "
"the :guilabel:`six squares` icon, located to the left of each line item."
msgstr ""
"Træk og slip derefter produktet til den ønskede position via "
"ikonet :guilabel:`seks firkanter`, der findes til venstre for hvert "
"linjeelement."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:98
msgid ""
"To add a *section*, which serves as a header to organize the lines of a "
"sales order, click :guilabel:`Add a section` in the :guilabel:`Lines` tab. "
"When clicked, a blank field appears, in which the desired name of the "
"section can be typed. When the name has been entered, click away to secure "
"the section name. Then, drag and drop the section name to the desired "
"position, via the :icon:`oi-apps` :guilabel:`(six squares)` icon, located to "
"the left of each line item."
msgstr ""
"For at tilføje en *sektion*, der fungerer som en overskrift til organisering "
"af linjerne på en salgsordre, skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Tilføj en "
"sektion` på fanen :guilabel:`Linjer`. Når der klikkes, vises et tomt felt, "
"hvori det ønskede sektionsnavn kan indtastes. Når navnet er indtastet, "
"klikkes udenfor for at fastlåse sektionsnavnet. Træk og slip derefter "
"sektionsnavnet til den ønskede placering via ikonet :icon:`oi-"
"apps` :guilabel:`(seks firkanter)`, der er placeret til venstre for hver "
"linjepost."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:104
msgid ""
"To add a note, which appears as a piece of text for the customer on the "
"quotation, click :guilabel:`Add a note` in the :guilabel:`Lines` tab. When "
"clicked, a blank field appears, in which the desired note can be typed. When "
"the note has been entered, click away to secure the note. Then, drag and "
"drop the note to the desired position, via the :icon:`oi-"
"apps` :guilabel:`(six squares)` icon."
msgstr ""
"For at tilføje et notat, som vises som en tekst for kunden på tilbuddet, "
"skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Tilføj et notat` på fanen :guilabel:`Linjer`. "
"Når der klikkes, vises et tomt felt, hvori det ønskede notat kan indtastes. "
"Når notatet er indtastet, klikkes udenfor for at fastlåse notatet. Træk og "
"slip derefter notatet til den ønskede placering via ikonet :icon:`oi-"
"apps` :guilabel:`(seks firkanter)`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:110
msgid ""
"To delete any line item from the :guilabel:`Lines` tab (product, section, "
"and/or note), click the :icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`(remove record)` icon on "
"the far-right side of the line."
msgstr ""
"For at slette et linjeelement fra fanen :guilabel:`Linjer` (produkt, sektion "
"og/eller note) skal du klikke på ikonet :icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`(fjern "
"post)` helt til højre på linjen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:114
msgid "Terms & Conditions tab"
msgstr "Fanen Vilkår og betingelser"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:116
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Terms & Conditions` tab provides the opportunity to add terms "
"and conditions to the quotation template. To add terms and conditions, type "
"the desired terms and conditions in this tab."
msgstr ""
"Fanen :guilabel:`Vilkår og betingelser` giver mulighed for at tilføje vilkår "
"og betingelser til tilbudsskabelonen. For at tilføje vilkår og betingelser "
"skal du skrive de ønskede vilkår og betingelser i denne fane."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:120
msgid ":doc:`../../../finance/accounting/customer_invoices/terms_conditions`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../../finance/accounting/customer_invoices/terms_conditions`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:123
msgid ""
"Terms and conditions are **not** required to create a quotation template."
msgstr ""
"Vilkår og betingelser er **ikke** påkrævet for at oprette en tilbudsskabelon."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:126
msgid "Quote Builder tab"
msgstr "Fanen Tilbudsbygger"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:129
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`PDF Quote builder` checkbox must be enabled for this tab to "
"become available."
msgstr ""
"Afkrydsningsfeltet :guilabel:`PDF-tilbudsbygger` skal være aktiveret, for at "
"denne fane bliver tilgængelig."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:131
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Quote Builder` tab allows specific headers and footers to "
"become available when the quotation template is used on a sales quote. Any "
"headers or footers that are :ref:`assigned to the template "
"<pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_quotes/add-to-quote-template>` are not available "
"to use unless the template is applied."
msgstr ""
"Fanen :guilabel:`Tilbudsbygger` gør det muligt at gøre specifikke "
"sidehoveder og sidefødder tilgængelige, når tilbudsskabelonen bruges på et "
"salgstilbud. Sidehoveder eller sidefødder, der er :ref:`tildelt skabelonen "
"<pdf_quote_builder/add_pdf_quotes/add-to-quote-template>`, er ikke "
"tilgængelige til brug, medmindre skabelonen anvendes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:137
msgid "Settings tab"
msgstr "Fanen Indstillinger"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:139
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Settings` tab provides extra confirmation and invoicing "
"settings to the quotation template."
msgstr ""
"Fanen :guilabel:`Indstillinger` giver ekstra bekræftelses- og "
"faktureringsindstillinger til tilbudsskabelonen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:142
msgid ""
"In the *Confirmation* section, the :guilabel:`Quotation Validity` field "
"designates how many days the quotation template is valid for, or leave the "
"field on the default `0` to keep the template valid indefinitely."
msgstr ""
"I afsnittet *Bekræftelse* angiver feltet :guilabel:`Tilbudsgyldighed`, hvor "
"mange dage tilbudsskabelonen er gyldig, eller lad feltet have "
"standardværdien `0` for at holde skabelonen gyldig på ubestemt tid."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:146
msgid ""
"If either of the :guilabel:`Online Signature` or :guilabel:`Online Payment` "
"features are activated in the :guilabel:`Settings` (:menuselection:`Sales "
"app --> Configuration --> Settings`), toggles for each of them are available "
"to activate on the quotation template."
msgstr ""
"Hvis enten :guilabel:`Online underskrift` eller :guilabel:`Online betaling` "
"er aktiveret i :guilabel:`Indstillinger` (:menuselection:`Salg-app --> "
"Konfiguration --> Indstillinger`), er der til/fra-knapper tilgængelige for "
"hver af dem til aktivering på tilbudsskabelonen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:150
msgid ""
"Enable the toggle for :guilabel:`Online Signature` to request an online "
"signature from the customer to confirm an order."
msgstr ""
"Slå til/fra-knappen for :guilabel:`Online underskrift` til for at anmode "
"kunden om en online underskrift til at bekræfte en ordre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:153
msgid ""
"Enable the toggle for :guilabel:`Online Payment` to request an online "
"payment from the customer to confirm an order. When :guilabel:`Online "
"Payment` is checked, a new percentage field appears, in which a specific "
"percentage of payment can be entered."
msgstr ""
"Slå til/fra-knappen for :guilabel:`Online betaling` til for at anmode kunden "
"om en online betaling til at bekræfte en ordre. Når :guilabel:`Online "
"betaling` er markeret, vises et nyt procentfelt, hvor der kan indtastes en "
"specifik betalingsprocentdel."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:157
msgid ""
"Both toggles, :guilabel:`Online Signature` and :guilabel:`Online Payment` "
"can be enabled simultaneously, in which case the customer must provide "
"**both** a signature **and** a payment to confirm an order."
msgstr ""
"Begge til/fra-knapper, :guilabel:`Online underskrift` og :guilabel:`Online "
"betaling`, kan aktiveres samtidigt, i hvilket tilfælde kunden skal angive "
"**både** en underskrift **og** en betaling for at bekræfte en ordre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:161
msgid ""
"Next, in the :guilabel:`Confirmation Mail` field, click the blank drop-down "
"menu to select a preconfigured email template to be sent to customers upon "
"confirmation of an order."
msgstr ""
"Klik dernæst i feltet :guilabel:`Bekræftelsesmail` på den tomme rullemenu "
"for at vælge en prækonfigureret e-mailskabelon, der skal sendes til kunder "
"ved bekræftelse af en ordre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:165
msgid ""
"To create a new email template directly from the :guilabel:`Confirmation "
"Mail` field, start typing the name of the new email template in the field, "
"and select either: :guilabel:`Create` or :guilabel:`Create and edit...` from "
"the drop-down menu that appears."
msgstr ""
"For at oprette en ny e-mailskabelon direkte fra "
"feltet :guilabel:`Bekræftelsesmail` skal du begynde at skrive navnet på den "
"nye e-mailskabelon i feltet og vælge enten: :guilabel:`Opret` "
"eller :guilabel:`Opret og rediger...` fra rullemenuen, der vises."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:169
msgid ""
"Selecting :guilabel:`Create` creates the email template, which can be edited "
"later."
msgstr ""
"Når du vælger :guilabel:`Opret`, oprettes e-mailskabelonen, som kan "
"redigeres senere."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:171
msgid ""
"Selecting :guilabel:`Create and edit...` creates the email template, and "
"a :guilabel:`Create Confirmation Mail` pop-up window appears, in which the "
"email template can be customized and configured immediately."
msgstr ""
"Når du vælger :guilabel:`Opret og rediger...`, oprettes e-mailskabelonen, og "
"et pop op-vindue :guilabel:`Opret Bekræftelsesmail` vises, hvor e-"
"mailskabelonen kan tilpasses og konfigureres med det samme."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:175
msgid ""
"Create confirmation mail pop-up window from the quotation template form in "
"Odoo Sales."
msgstr ""
"Pop op-vinduet Opret bekræftelsesmail fra tilbudsskabelonformularen i Odoo "
"Salg."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:178
msgid ""
"When all modifications are complete, click :guilabel:`Save & Close` to save "
"the email template and return to the quotation form."
msgstr ""
"Når alle ændringer er færdige, skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Gem & Luk` for "
"at gemme e-mailskabelonen og vende tilbage til tilbudsformularen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:181
msgid ""
"In the *Invoicing* section, the :guilabel:`Invoicing Journal` field "
"designates all sales orders using this template are invoiced in the selected "
"journal. If no journal is selected, the sales journal with the lowest "
"sequence is used."
msgstr ""
"I afsnittet *Fakturering* angiver feltet :guilabel:`Faktureringsjournal`, at "
"alle salgsordrer, der bruger denne skabelon, faktureres i den valgte "
"journal. Hvis der ikke er valgt en journal, bruges salgsjournalen med den "
"laveste rækkefølge."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:188
msgid "Create section templates"
msgstr "Opret afsnitsskabeloner"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:190
msgid ""
"Section templates can be created on the *Templates* page or directly from a "
"sales quote. To create a template from the *Templates* page, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Configuration --> Templates` and click "
"the :guilabel:`New` button, located in the upper-left corner. A blank "
"template form displays."
msgstr ""
"Afsnitsskabeloner kan oprettes på siden *Skabeloner* eller direkte fra et "
"salgstilbud. For at oprette en skabelon fra siden *Skabeloner* skal du "
"navigere til :menuselection:`Salg-app --> Konfiguration --> Skabeloner` og "
"klikke på knappen :guilabel:`Ny` i øverste venstre hjørne. En tom "
"skabelonformular vises."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:195
msgid ""
"Enter the name of the template in :guilabel:`Template` field and set "
"the :guilabel:`Type` field to :guilabel:`Section`. To add sections, "
"products, or notes follow the instructions in the :ref:`sales/quote_template/"
"lines-tab` section."
msgstr ""
"Indtast skabelonens navn i feltet :guilabel:`Skabelon`, og sæt "
"feltet :guilabel:`Type` til :guilabel:`Afsnit`. For at tilføje afsnit, "
"produkter eller noter skal du følge instruktionerne i afsnittet :ref:`sales/"
"quote_template/lines-tab`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:200
msgid ""
"Only the :guilabel:`Lines` tab is available for section templates. Templates "
"with the same name and created by the same user are overwritten when saved. "
"Combos **cannot** be saved as a section template."
msgstr ""
"Kun fanen :guilabel:`Linjer` er tilgængelig for afsnitsskabeloner. "
"Skabeloner med samme navn oprettet af den samme bruger overskrives, når de "
"gemmes. Kombinationer kan **ikke** gemmes som en afsnitsskabelon."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:204
msgid ""
"To create a section template from a sales quote, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Sales app --> Orders --> Quotations` and :ref:`create a "
"new quote <sales/create_quotations/create-quotation>` or select an existing "
"one."
msgstr ""
"For at oprette en afsnitsskabelon fra et salgstilbud skal du navigere "
"til :menuselection:`Salg-app --> Ordrer --> Tilbud` og :ref:`oprette et nyt "
"tilbud <sales/create_quotations/create-quotation>` eller vælge et "
"eksisterende."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:208
msgid ""
"Add section and any products in the :guilabel:`Order Lines` tab, then click "
"the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`Ellipsis` icon on the right side of the "
"order line. Select the :icon:`fa-save` :guilabel:`Save as Template` icon to "
"save the section. Odoo saves the section template using the name given the "
"section on the sales quote."
msgstr ""
"Tilføj et afsnit og eventuelle produkter under "
"fanen :guilabel:`Ordrelinjer`, og klik derefter på ikonet :icon:`fa-ellipsis-"
"v` :guilabel:`Ellipsis` i højre side af ordrelinjen. Vælg ikonet :icon:`fa-"
"save` :guilabel:`Gem som skabelon` for at gemme afsnittet. Odoo gemmer "
"afsnitsskabelonen med det navn, der er givet til afsnittet på salgstilbuddet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:213
msgid ""
"A sales quote's order line submenu that contains the Save as Template option."
msgstr ""
"Undermenuen på et salgstilbuds ordrelinje, der indeholder valgmuligheden Gem "
"som skabelon."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:217
msgid ""
"Section templates can be saved without any products added in the section."
msgstr "Afsnitsskabeloner kan gemmes uden tilføjede produkter i afsnittet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:219
msgid ""
"To find a section template, navigate to :menuselection:`Sales --> "
"Configuration --> Templates`. In the search bar, delete "
"the :guilabel:`Quotation Templates filter` to display all template types."
msgstr ""
"For at finde en afsnitsskabelon skal du navigere til :menuselection:`Salg --"
"> Konfiguration --> Skabeloner`. I søgefeltet skal du fjerne "
"filteret :guilabel:`Tilbudsskabeloner-filter` for at få vist alle "
"skabelontyper."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:225
msgid "Use templates"
msgstr "Brug skabeloner"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:227
msgid ""
"When :ref:`creating a quote <sales/create_quotations/create-quotation>` "
"(:menuselection:`Sales app --> New`), choose a preconfigured template in "
"the :guilabel:`Quotation Template` field."
msgstr ""
"Når du :ref:`opretter et tilbud <sales/create_quotations/create-quotation>` "
"(:menuselection:`Salg-app --> Ny`), skal du vælge en forudkonfigureret "
"skabelon i feltet :guilabel:`Tilbudsskabelon`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:231
msgid ""
"The order of the templates in the :guilabel:`Quotation Template` field is "
"determined by the order of the templates in the Quotation Templates form. "
"The order of the quotations in the Quotation Templates form does **not** "
"affect anything else."
msgstr ""
"Rækkefølgen af skabelonerne i feltet :guilabel:`Tilbudsskabelon` bestemmes "
"af rækkefølgen af skabelonerne i formularen Tilbudsskabeloner. Rækkefølgen "
"af tilbuddene i formularen Tilbudsskabeloner påvirker **ikke** noget andet."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:235
msgid ""
"To apply a section template, click :guilabel:`Add a section` and select a "
"template from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"For at anvende en afsnitsskabelon skal du klikke på :guilabel:`Tilføj et "
"afsnit` og vælge en skabelon fra rullemenuen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:238
msgid ""
"To view what the customer will see, click the :guilabel:`Preview` button at "
"the top of the page to see how the quotation template appears on the front-"
"end of the website through Odoo's customer portal."
msgstr ""
"For at se, hvad kunden vil se, skal du klikke på "
"knappen :guilabel:`Forhåndsvisning` øverst på siden for at se, hvordan "
"tilbudsskabelonen vises på hjemmesidens front-end gennem Odoos kundeportal."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:242
msgid "Customer preview of a quotation template in Odoo Sales."
msgstr "Kundeforhåndsvisning af en tilbudsskabelon i Odoo Salg."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:245
msgid ""
"When all blocks and customizations are complete, click the :guilabel:`Save` "
"button to save the configuration."
msgstr ""
"Når alle blokke og tilpasninger er fuldført, skal du klikke på "
"knappen :guilabel:`Gem` for at gemme konfigurationen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:248
msgid ""
"The blue banner located at the top of the quotation template preview can be "
"used to quickly return :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Back to edit mode`. "
"When clicked, Odoo returns to the quotation form in the back-end of the "
"*Sales* application."
msgstr ""
"Det blå banner placeret øverst i forhåndsvisningen af tilbudsskabelonen kan "
"bruges til hurtigt at vende :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Tilbage til "
"redigeringstilstand`. Når der klikkes, vender Odoo tilbage til "
"tilbudsformularen i back-enden af *Salg*-applikationen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:253
msgid "Mass cancel quotations/sales orders"
msgstr "Masseannullering af tilbud/salgsordrer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:255
msgid ""
"Cancel multiple quotations (or sales orders) by navigating to "
"the :menuselection:`Sales app --> Orders --> Quotations` dashboard, landing, "
"by default, in the list view. Then, on the left side of the table, tick the "
"checkboxes for the quotations to be canceled."
msgstr ""
"Annuller flere tilbud (eller salgsordrer) ved at navigere til "
"dashboardet :menuselection:`Salg-app --> Ordrer --> Tilbud`, som som "
"standard lander i listevisningen. Derefter skal du på venstre side af "
"tabellen markere afkrydsningsfelterne for de tilbud, der skal annulleres."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:260
msgid ""
"Select all records in the table by selecting the checkbox column header at "
"the top-left of the table; the total number of selected items are displayed "
"at the top of the page."
msgstr ""
"Vælg alle poster i tabellen ved at markere afkrydsningsfeltet i "
"kolonneoverskriften øverst til venstre i tabellen; det samlede antal valgte "
"elementer vises øverst på siden."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:263
msgid ""
"Then, with the desired quotations (or sales orders) selected from the list "
"view on the :guilabel:`Quotations` page, click the :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`Actions` button to reveal a drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Med de ønskede tilbud (eller salgsordrer) valgt fra listevisningen på "
"siden :guilabel:`Tilbud` skal du derefter klikke på knappen :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`Handlinger` for at få vist en rullemenu."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:267
msgid "From this drop-down menu, select :guilabel:`Cancel quotations`."
msgstr "Fra denne rullemenu vælg :guilabel:`Annullér tilbud`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:269
msgid ""
"The Cancel quotations option on the Actions drop-down menu in the Odoo Sales "
"application."
msgstr ""
"Indstillingen Annullér tilbud i rullemenuen Handlinger i Odoo Salg-"
"applikationen."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:273
msgid ""
"This action can be performed for quotations in *any* stage, even if it is "
"confirmed as a sales order."
msgstr ""
"Denne handling kan udføres for tilbud i *ethvert* trin, selv hvis det er "
"bekræftet som en salgsordre."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:276
msgid ""
"Upon selecting the :guilabel:`Cancel quotations` option, a :guilabel:`Cancel "
"quotations` confirmation pop-up window appears. To complete the "
"cancellation, click the :guilabel:`Cancel quotations` button."
msgstr ""
"Når du vælger indstillingen :guilabel:`Annullér tilbud`, vises et pop-up-"
"vindue :guilabel:`Annullér tilbud` til bekræftelse. For at fuldføre "
"annulleringen skal du klikke på knappen :guilabel:`Annullér tilbud`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:281
msgid ""
"An error pop-up message appears when attempting to cancel an order for an "
"ongoing subscription that has an invoice."
msgstr ""
"En fejlmeddelelse vises, når du forsøger at annullere en ordre for et "
"igangværende abonnement, der har en faktura."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/sales_quotations/quote_template.rst:287
msgid "`Tutorial: Quote calculator Basics <quote-calculator_>`_"
msgstr "`Vejledning: Grundlæggende om tilbudsberegner <quote-calculator_>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector.rst:5
msgid "Shopee Connector"
msgstr "Shopee Connector"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/features.rst:3
msgid "Shopee Connector features"
msgstr "Shopee Connector | Funktioner"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/features.rst:5
msgid ""
"The **Shopee Connector** synchronizes orders between Shopee and Odoo, which "
"considerably reduces the amount of time spent manually entering Shopee "
"orders (from the Shopee Seller account) into Odoo. It also allows users to "
"accurately keep track of Shopee sales in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"**Shopee Connector** synkroniserer ordrer mellem Shopee og Odoo, hvilket "
"betydeligt reducerer den tid, der bruges på manuelt at indtaste Shopee-"
"ordrer (fra Shopee Seller-kontoen) i Odoo. Det giver også brugerne mulighed "
"for præcist at holde styr på Shopee-salg i Odoo."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/features.rst:12
msgid "The **Shopee Connector** is able to:"
msgstr "**Shopee Connector** kan:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/features.rst:14
msgid ""
"Synchronize (Shopee to Odoo) all confirmed orders, and their order items, "
"which include:"
msgstr ""
"Synkronisere (Shopee til Odoo) alle bekræftede ordrer og deres ordrelinjer, "
"som omfatter:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/features.rst:20
msgid ""
"Synchronize (Odoo to Shopee) all available quantities of products "
"(:abbr:`FBM (Fulfilled by Merchant)`)."
msgstr ""
"Synkroniser (Odoo til Shopee) alle tilgængelige mængder af produkter "
"(:abbr:`FBM (Fulfilled by Merchant)`)."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/features.rst:23
msgid "Support multiple Shopee marketplaces (shops) per seller account."
msgstr "Understøtte flere Shopee-markedspladser (butikker) pr. sælgerkonto."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/sales/shopee_connector/features.rst:26
msgid ""
"The **Shopee Connector** is designed to synchronize sales orders data. Other "
"actions, such as downloading weekly/monthly income/fees reports, handling "
"disputes, or issuing refunds, **must** be managed from the *Shopee Seller "
"Central*, as usual."
msgstr ""
"**Shopee Connector** er designet til at synkronisere salgsordredata. Andre "
"handlinger, såsom download af ugentlige/månedlige indtægts-/gebyrrapporter, "
"håndtering af tvister eller udstedelse af refusioner, **skal** håndteres fra "
"*Shopee Seller Central* som sædvanligt."

