#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:-1
msgid ""
"This page explains how loyalty and discount programs apply to subscription "
"products through the Recurring option for conditional rules and rewards, and "
"which program types support Recurring for rules, rewards, or both."
msgstr ""
"Denne side forklarer, hvordan loyalitets- og rabatprogrammer gælder for "
"abonnementsprodukter via indstillingen Tilbagevendende for betingede regler "
"og belønninger, samt hvilke programtyper der understøtter Tilbagevendende "
"for regler, belønninger eller begge dele."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:8
msgid "Subscriptions and loyalty programs"
msgstr "Abonnementer og loyalitetsprogrammer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:10
msgid ""
"In addition to standard pricelists and per-order discounts, the Odoo "
"**Subscriptions** app is compatible with dedicated loyalty and discount "
"programs. Once :ref:`loyalty and discount programs have been enabled <sales/"
"loyalty_discount/configure-settings>`, subscription-specific programs may be "
"created."
msgstr ""
"Ud over standardprislister og rabatter pr. ordre er Odoo **Abonnementer**-"
"appen kompatibel med dedikerede loyalitets- og rabatprogrammer. "
"Når :ref:`loyalitets- og rabatprogrammer er blevet aktiveret <sales/"
"loyalty_discount/configure-settings>`, kan der oprettes "
"abonnementsspecifikke programmer."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:16
msgid "Configure loyalty programs for subscriptions"
msgstr "Konfigurer loyalitetsprogrammer for abonnementer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:18
msgid ""
"The process for creating a subscription-specific program is similar "
"to :ref:`the normal process <sales/loyalty_discount/configure-programs>`, "
"but there are a few considerations to keep in mind. With the "
"**Subscriptions** app installed, both :guilabel:`conditional rules` "
"and :guilabel:`rewards` may be marked as :guilabel:`Recurring`."
msgstr ""
"Processen med at oprette et abonnementsspecifikt program ligner :ref:`den "
"normale proces <sales/loyalty_discount/configure-programs>`, men der er et "
"par overvejelser, du bør have i mente. Når appen **Abonnementer** er "
"installeret, kan både :guilabel:`betingede regler` "
"og :guilabel:`belønninger` markeres som :guilabel:`Tilbagevendende`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:23
msgid ""
"However, not every program can be saved and utilized when both checkboxes "
"are checked. Attempting to enable the :guilabel:`Recurring` checkbox for "
"*conditional rules* when the program doesn't support it results in a "
"*Validation Error* pop-up when saving the program."
msgstr ""
"Det er dog ikke alle programmer, der kan gemmes og anvendes, når begge "
"afkrydsningsfelter er markeret. Hvis du forsøger at markere "
"afkrydsningsfeltet :guilabel:`Tilbagevendende` for *betingede regler*, når "
"programmet ikke understøtter det, vises en pop-up med *Valideringsfejl*, når "
"programmet gemmes."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:28
msgid "Programs that support recurring rules and rewards"
msgstr "Programmer, der understøtter tilbagevendende regler og belønninger"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:33
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Recurring` checkbox may be enabled for both rules and "
"rewards. Enabling the checkbox for rules ensures that customers may earn "
"loyalty points during each renewal period, so long as they meet the "
"requirements. Enabling the checkbox for rewards ensures that earned loyalty "
"points are automatically exchanged for applied rewards during each period."
msgstr ""
"Afkrydsningsfeltet :guilabel:`Tilbagevendende` kan aktiveres for både regler "
"og belønninger. Aktivering af afkrydsningsfeltet for regler sikrer, at "
"kunder kan optjene loyalitetspoint i hver fornyelsesperiode, så længe de "
"opfylder kravene. Aktivering af afkrydsningsfeltet for belønninger sikrer, "
"at optjente loyalitetspoint automatisk veksles til anvendte belønninger i "
"hver periode."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:39
msgid "Next order coupons"
msgstr "Kuponer til næste ordre"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:41
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Recurring` checkbox may be enabled for both rules and "
"rewards. Enabling the checkbox for rules ensures that customers may earn "
"coupons good for their next order during each renewal period, so long as "
"they meet the requirements. Enabling the checkbox for rewards ensures that "
"earned coupons are automatically exchanged for applied rewards during each "
"period."
msgstr ""
"Afkrydsningsfeltet :guilabel:`Tilbagevendende` kan aktiveres for både regler "
"og belønninger. Aktivering af afkrydsningsfeltet for regler sikrer, at "
"kunder kan optjene kuponer, der gælder til deres næste ordre, i hver "
"fornyelsesperiode, så længe de opfylder kravene. Aktivering af "
"afkrydsningsfeltet for belønninger sikrer, at optjente kuponer automatisk "
"veksles til anvendte belønninger i hver periode."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:47
msgid "Programs that only support recurring rules"
msgstr "Programmer, der kun understøtter tilbagevendende regler"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:50
msgid "Coupons"
msgstr "Kuponer"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:52
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Recurring` checkbox may be enabled for rewards only. Doing so "
"ensures that earned coupons are automatically applied during each renewal "
"period."
msgstr ""
"Afkrydsningsfeltet :guilabel:`Tilbagevendende` kan kun aktiveres for "
"belønninger. Dette sikrer, at optjente kuponer automatisk anvendes i hver "
"fornyelsesperiode."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:58
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Recurring` checkbox may be enabled for rewards only. Doing so "
"ensures that earned promotional rewards are automatically applied during "
"each renewal period."
msgstr ""
"Afkrydsningsfeltet :guilabel:`Tilbagevendende` kan kun aktiveres for "
"belønninger. Dette sikrer, at optjente kampagnebelønninger automatisk "
"anvendes i hver fornyelsesperiode."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:62
msgid "Discount code"
msgstr "Rabatkode"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:64
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Recurring` checkbox may be enabled for rewards only. Doing so "
"ensures that earned discount codes are automatically applied during each "
"renewal period."
msgstr ""
"Afkrydsningsfeltet :guilabel:`Tilbagevendende` kan kun aktiveres for "
"belønninger. Dette sikrer, at optjente rabatkoder automatisk anvendes i hver "
"fornyelsesperiode."

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:68
msgid "Buy X, Get Y"
msgstr "Køb X, få Y"

#: ../../export/content/applications/sales/subscriptions/subscriptions_loyalty.rst:70
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Recurring` checkbox may be enabled for rewards only. Doing so "
"ensures that earned rewards are automatically applied during each renewal "
"period."
msgstr ""
"Afkrydsningsfeltet :guilabel:`Tilbagevendende` kan kun aktiveres for "
"belønninger. Dette sikrer, at optjente belønninger automatisk anvendes i "
"hver fornyelsesperiode."

